(953887, 111856, 22748, '<td valign="top">Very nice and smooth feeling. Soft focus effect? NeatImage? I''m sure you''ll get plenty of people complaining that it''s got ''too much NeatImage'', regardless of whether you actually used it. Whatever. I like it. Nice white eyes although the irises are a bit blurred, which is the one part that feels funny, one expects to see the natural radial patterns in them.</td>', 'Very nice and smooth feeling. Soft focus effect? NeatImage? I''m sure you''ll get plenty of people complaining that it''s got ''too much NeatImage'', regardless of whether you actually used it. Whatever. I like it. Nice white eyes although the irises are a bit blurred, which is the one part that feels funny, one expects to see the natural radial patterns in them.', '2004-10-11 03:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(953888, 111728, 22748, '<td valign="top">Great contrast and B&amp;W tones.  Once again, I bet you get people complaining about ''cliche selective desat'' but I think this is beautiful.</td>', 'Great contrast and B&W tones.  Once again, I bet you get people complaining about ''cliche selective desat'' but I think this is beautiful.', '2004-10-11 03:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(953890, 111705, 22748, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Nice idea with the reflection.  Good sharp shot. However, seeing all the little hairs this close up protruding from the skin is really kind of disconcerting/yucky to look at for me. Nothing against the model, it''s just that when a photo is 10X life size like this, natural features can sometimes begin to look weird and gross.</td>', 'Interesting. Nice idea with the reflection.  Good sharp shot. However, seeing all the little hairs this close up protruding from the skin is really kind of disconcerting/yucky to look at for me. Nothing against the model, it''s just that when a photo is 10X life size like this, natural features can sometimes begin to look weird and gross.', '2004-10-11 03:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(953891, 111816, 22748, '<td valign="top">Cute idea but doesn''t meet the challenge IMO (the description mentions a defining feature of a ''person'').</td>', 'Cute idea but doesn''t meet the challenge IMO (the description mentions a defining feature of a ''person'').', '2004-10-11 03:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(953894, 111212, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, interesting picture, but the challenge clearly states "Take a picture of a person''s defining feature." and I don''t feel this meets it. Unless that''s a person in a bird suit? Yeah, I will persist in voting based on the challenge topic, that''s the whole point a "challenge" and of DPC.</td>', 'Nice colors, interesting picture, but the challenge clearly states "Take a picture of a person''s defining feature." and I don''t feel this meets it. Unless that''s a person in a bird suit? Yeah, I will persist in voting based on the challenge topic, that''s the whole point a "challenge" and of DPC.', '2004-10-11 03:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
