(953901, 111501, 22748, '<td valign="top">Cool! I love the OOF face in the background! <br/> <br/>Funny, this is the second picture yet with the title ''Attitude''.</td>', 'Cool! I love the OOF face in the background!  Funny, this is the second picture yet with the title ''Attitude''.', '2004-10-11 03:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(953902, 111689, 22748, '<td valign="top">I think the old-photo effect is significantly overdone here. It just sort of looks like the roll of film was accidentally exposed to sunlight or something, just too little contrast.</td>', 'I think the old-photo effect is significantly overdone here. It just sort of looks like the roll of film was accidentally exposed to sunlight or something, just too little contrast.', '2004-10-11 03:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(953903, 111571, 22748, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice. A little bit blurry, but not toooo bad. The eyes and lips are really pretty. Oh, and that''s a tasteful border. :)</td>', 'Pretty nice. A little bit blurry, but not toooo bad. The eyes and lips are really pretty. Oh, and that''s a tasteful border. :)', '2004-10-11 03:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(953904, 111815, 22748, '<td valign="top">Wow, if that''s someone''s defining feature, they must be a really shallow person. :-P  Of course I''m mostly joking. Technically speaking, though, there are nice smooth skin tones and mostly even lighting.</td>', 'Wow, if that''s someone''s defining feature, they must be a really shallow person. :-P  Of course I''m mostly joking. Technically speaking, though, there are nice smooth skin tones and mostly even lighting.', '2004-10-11 03:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(953906, 111848, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice. I only wish we could see more of her though, especially her face. I like the lighting , it makes the textures interesting.</td>', 'Nice. I only wish we could see more of her though, especially her face. I like the lighting , it makes the textures interesting.', '2004-10-11 03:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(953907, 111092, 22748, '<td valign="top">Great expression! I''d like to see more of this model. The lighting is interesting but the hair on the left side of the frame is a touch too dark, especially relative to the hair on the right edge, on the other side of her face. Also, there is a slightly distracting reflection on her forehead right at the edge of the frame. Like I said, the light is interesting but, probably as a result of the dramatic angle and hardness of the lighting, and also the B&amp;W conversion process, perhaps more skin imperfections are showing? I certainly couldn''t say without seeing a color version and/or seeing her in person, but just a suggestion. Softer, more diffused light would hide pores and other textural features of the skin.  Playing with the channel mixer can either amplify or hide things like freckles and other color-related features of the skin.<br/> <br/>Anyway, I still like the dramatic look of this photo and the detailed textures here. It''s really different than a lot of the portraits you see of females.</td>', 'Great expression! I''d like to see more of this model. The lighting is interesting but the hair on the left side of the frame is a touch too dark, especially relative to the hair on the right edge, on the other side of her face. Also, there is a slightly distracting reflection on her forehead right at the edge of the frame. Like I said, the light is interesting but, probably as a result of the dramatic angle and hardness of the lighting, and also the B&W conversion process, perhaps more skin imperfections are showing? I certainly couldn''t say without seeing a color version and/or seeing her in person, but just a suggestion. Softer, more diffused light would hide pores and other textural features of the skin.  Playing with the channel mixer can either amplify or hide things like freckles and other color-related features of the skin. Anyway, I still like the dramatic look of this photo and the detailed textures here. It''s really different than a lot of the portraits you see of females.', '2004-10-11 04:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(953908, 111884, 16046, '<td valign="top">I would focus on closest eye, still a nice shot</td>', 'I would focus on closest eye, still a nice shot', '2004-10-11 04:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
