(954622, 111814, 23956, '<td valign="top">The strongest image in this group! I love the journalistic nature of this shot, as well as the feature you chose to portray. Very very nice.</td>', 'The strongest image in this group! I love the journalistic nature of this shot, as well as the feature you chose to portray. Very very nice.', '2004-10-11 16:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
