(954804, 111888, 6667, '<td valign="top">I agree!  And you got a high score from me to prove it. BOL!  I love the black vs white sides of the scene.  Was that planned or a serendipitous event?  Also did you adjust the eye colors?  IMHO the black should have been deeper or richer in depth or glassier.  But it was the wistful grin that got your score from me.</td>', 'I agree!  And you got a high score from me to prove it. BOL!  I love the black vs white sides of the scene.  Was that planned or a serendipitous event?  Also did you adjust the eye colors?  IMHO the black should have been deeper or richer in depth or glassier.  But it was the wistful grin that got your score from me.', '2004-10-11 18:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(954809, 111801, 6667, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition.  I wonder if onl the hair and right I would have been more effective. The very light skin tone is a wash out,  But that is only my opinion. BOL</td>', 'Beautiful composition.  I wonder if onl the hair and right I would have been more effective. The very light skin tone is a wash out,  But that is only my opinion. BOL', '2004-10-11 18:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(954810, 110972, 6667, '<td valign="top">Love it. BOL  And. . . I''m betting she''s a great football (soccer) player too!</td>', 'Love it. BOL  And. . . I''m betting she''s a great football (soccer) player too!', '2004-10-11 18:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(954812, 111686, 18191, '<td valign="top">Hehe :-p</td>', 'Hehe :-p', '2004-10-11 18:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(954814, 111844, 6667, '<td valign="top">Oui, oui! But a little too difused for my taste. BOL</td>', 'Oui, oui! But a little too difused for my taste. BOL', '2004-10-11 18:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(954820, 110501, 6667, '<td valign="top">Nice pose. Super rich tones. The thickness of her hair is not bad also!  The only distraction is . . . the nose needs powdering.  BOL</td>', 'Nice pose. Super rich tones. The thickness of her hair is not bad also!  The only distraction is . . . the nose needs powdering.  BOL', '2004-10-11 18:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(954822, 111370, 6667, '<td valign="top">And what about the lips also?!  BOL</td>', 'And what about the lips also?!  BOL', '2004-10-11 18:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(954890, 110344, 25464, '<td valign="top">This photo definitely conveys a personality trait.  The only thing I notice at all is the focus is a little sharper on the hat than the face, especially the mouth and chin area.  Great expression and great colors.</td>', 'This photo definitely conveys a personality trait.  The only thing I notice at all is the focus is a little sharper on the hat than the face, especially the mouth and chin area.  Great expression and great colors.', '2004-10-11 19:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(954893, 111473, 25464, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective.  Nice black and white.</td>', 'Simple and effective.  Nice black and white.', '2004-10-11 19:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(954900, 111321, 25464, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems a bit harsh, which I realize may be intentional, but it doesn''t really accentuate the feature you are trying to show imo.  The composition is interesting though.</td>', 'The lighting seems a bit harsh, which I realize may be intentional, but it doesn''t really accentuate the feature you are trying to show imo.  The composition is interesting though.', '2004-10-11 19:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(954908, 111730, 25464, '<td valign="top">The focus is a bit soft.  I am not opposed to soft focus, but I Ithink "Keeping Up Appearances" would be better conveyed with a sharp, crisp, focus.  That is just a suggestion, I am still giving a good score.  I really like thist idea .</td>', 'The focus is a bit soft.  I am not opposed to soft focus, but I Ithink "Keeping Up Appearances" would be better conveyed with a sharp, crisp, focus.  That is just a suggestion, I am still giving a good score.  I really like thist idea .', '2004-10-11 20:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(954912, 111501, 25464, '<td valign="top">Well theres a feature conveying a strong message.  I don''t know how it will do, but I think you met the challenge and the photo is well taken.  Cant see it hanging on my wall though.  Maybe in my car.</td>', 'Well theres a feature conveying a strong message.  I don''t know how it will do, but I think you met the challenge and the photo is well taken.  Cant see it hanging on my wall though.  Maybe in my car.', '2004-10-11 20:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(954943, 110484, 26756, '<td valign="top">I like this photo very much.  Someone''s "glow" is an interesting choice and you captured it pretty well.  I like the lighting on her and the frame to the right.  The only thing I don''t like about this photo is the metal corner.  It''s not too distracting but isn''t "earthy" like the rest of the picture.</td>', 'I like this photo very much.  Someone''s "glow" is an interesting choice and you captured it pretty well.  I like the lighting on her and the frame to the right.  The only thing I don''t like about this photo is the metal corner.  It''s not too distracting but isn''t "earthy" like the rest of the picture.', '2004-10-11 20:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(954946, 110344, 20330, '<td valign="top">very nice :)<br/></td>', 'very nice :)', '2004-10-11 20:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(954951, 111473, 20330, '<td valign="top">kinda looks like the challenge with the bottled water. nice stomach, wish mine looked like that ;o)</td>', 'kinda looks like the challenge with the bottled water. nice stomach, wish mine looked like that ;o)', '2004-10-11 20:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(954959, 111434, 10080, '<td valign="top">great textures!</td>', 'great textures!', '2004-10-11 20:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(954992, 111511, 11738, '<td valign="top">Should have cleaned that pinky nail.</td>', 'Should have cleaned that pinky nail.', '2004-10-11 21:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(954994, 111758, 20115, '<td valign="top">Well there is definitely no question as to what defines this guy.  I would have taken the picture without glasses and have him stare straight ahead at the camera.</td>', 'Well there is definitely no question as to what defines this guy.  I would have taken the picture without glasses and have him stare straight ahead at the camera.', '2004-10-11 21:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(954995, 111795, 26756, '<td valign="top">Odd that this subject should be a defining feature of someone, but technically the photo is really very pleasing.</td>', 'Odd that this subject should be a defining feature of someone, but technically the photo is really very pleasing.', '2004-10-11 21:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(954996, 111138, 11738, '<td valign="top">Man, now that''s a heavy frame!  A little over the top for my taste.  Too bad that the light was weak on the left side of the face creating blue-toned skin.</td>', 'Man, now that''s a heavy frame!  A little over the top for my taste.  Too bad that the light was weak on the left side of the face creating blue-toned skin.', '2004-10-11 21:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(954997, 111880, 20115, '<td valign="top">Much too dark--cannot see the callouses and roughness that define a person who works with his hands.</td>', 'Much too dark--cannot see the callouses and roughness that define a person who works with his hands.', '2004-10-11 21:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(954999, 111687, 20115, '<td valign="top">that''s right</td>', 'that''s right', '2004-10-11 21:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(955000, 111740, 16800, '<td valign="top">Now THAT is a defining feature!  In case it isn''t obvious, I''m a dimple junky.</td>', 'Now THAT is a defining feature!  In case it isn''t obvious, I''m a dimple junky.', '2004-10-11 21:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(955001, 111703, 20115, '<td valign="top">Overexposed--but beautiful hair</td>', 'Overexposed--but beautiful hair', '2004-10-11 21:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(955002, 111754, 20115, '<td valign="top">I think the baby should be in focus not the booties.</td>', 'I think the baby should be in focus not the booties.', '2004-10-11 21:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(955003, 111874, 11738, '<td valign="top">Man, the upside down thing really takes away from this image.</td>', 'Man, the upside down thing really takes away from this image.', '2004-10-11 21:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(955005, 111877, 20115, '<td valign="top">I think you got this wrong.  The challenge said "someone" -- I took it to mean a person.  Great shot though--keep a relationship with that spider--I''m sure he will come in handy in the future.</td>', 'I think you got this wrong.  The challenge said "someone" -- I took it to mean a person.  Great shot though--keep a relationship with that spider--I''m sure he will come in handy in the future.', '2004-10-11 21:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(955006, 111867, 26756, '<td valign="top">To me, a little too close for comfort.  Would have prefered to see the face including the beard.</td>', 'To me, a little too close for comfort.  Would have prefered to see the face including the beard.', '2004-10-11 21:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(955007, 111571, 20115, '<td valign="top">Oh my God what a face--sweet, pure, darling.  Beautiful job.</td>', 'Oh my God what a face--sweet, pure, darling.  Beautiful job.', '2004-10-11 21:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(955008, 111880, 11738, '<td valign="top">Carpenter needs to get more lights if he doesn''t want to smash his thumbs.  This image is quite dark and thus has low contrast.  Can''t tell if we''re looking down at water or up at some tree branches and sky.</td>', 'Carpenter needs to get more lights if he doesn''t want to smash his thumbs.  This image is quite dark and thus has low contrast.  Can''t tell if we''re looking down at water or up at some tree branches and sky.', '2004-10-11 21:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(955009, 111342, 20115, '<td valign="top">This is hysterical--love it.</td>', 'This is hysterical--love it.', '2004-10-11 21:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(955010, 111834, 26756, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and a good window into the personality.  Could be a bit crisper but a good effort.</td>', 'Nice shot and a good window into the personality.  Could be a bit crisper but a good effort.', '2004-10-11 21:23:22.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(955011, 111883, 11738, '<td valign="top">Quite a bit of blue cast to this image and there is major purple fringing on that plant in the background.  But I have to admit that the image was taken under very challenging light conditions.  Looks like he''s wearing a way cool coat.</td>', 'Quite a bit of blue cast to this image and there is major purple fringing on that plant in the background.  But I have to admit that the image was taken under very challenging light conditions.  Looks like he''s wearing a way cool coat.', '2004-10-11 21:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(955013, 111851, 11738, '<td valign="top">He''s cute alright.  Nice choice of sweater colour for the shot.</td>', 'He''s cute alright.  Nice choice of sweater colour for the shot.', '2004-10-11 21:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(955014, 111886, 11738, '<td valign="top">Ways cool tats, but I wish his fist had just a tad more light.</td>', 'Ways cool tats, but I wish his fist had just a tad more light.', '2004-10-11 21:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(955015, 111454, 21034, '<td valign="top">The lighting and composition are pretty good. The shadow on the left side is distracting, though.</td>', 'The lighting and composition are pretty good. The shadow on the left side is distracting, though.', '2004-10-11 21:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(955016, 111254, 11738, '<td valign="top">Looks like an add for Dockers.  Not quite centered, but clear image.  Good use of B&amp;W.</td>', 'Looks like an add for Dockers.  Not quite centered, but clear image.  Good use of B&W.', '2004-10-11 21:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(955017, 111501, 21034, '<td valign="top">Yeah, that''s attitude.  I''m all for stretching the Hallmark-shots-only attitude on this site. :)</td>', 'Yeah, that''s attitude.  I''m all for stretching the Hallmark-shots-only attitude on this site. :)', '2004-10-11 21:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(955020, 111558, 11738, '<td valign="top">Cool image, but I find the facial features too soft.  Almost looks like put through Neat Image a bit too much or a bit of overzealouness with gaussian blur.  Love the eye.</td>', 'Cool image, but I find the facial features too soft.  Almost looks like put through Neat Image a bit too much or a bit of overzealouness with gaussian blur.  Love the eye.', '2004-10-11 21:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(955022, 111875, 16829, '<td valign="top">I like the lines of the lighting, but to me there''s too much black area to keep the eye interested for very long.</td>', 'I like the lines of the lighting, but to me there''s too much black area to keep the eye interested for very long.', '2004-10-11 21:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(955023, 111728, 20115, '<td valign="top">Love this.  The color and light is perfect--the whole concept is deep.  Thanks for this one.</td>', 'Love this.  The color and light is perfect--the whole concept is deep.  Thanks for this one.', '2004-10-11 21:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(955025, 111726, 26756, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this shot a lot but I''m not sure I like the red highlighted so much.  Whiskey has such a nice color, to me it would have been cool to show the real skin tones, a clear glass and maybe some back-lit, glowing brown whiskey.  Great idea though.</td>', 'I like the idea of this shot a lot but I''m not sure I like the red highlighted so much.  Whiskey has such a nice color, to me it would have been cool to show the real skin tones, a clear glass and maybe some back-lit, glowing brown whiskey.  Great idea though.', '2004-10-11 21:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(955026, 111547, 20115, '<td valign="top">Definitely--looks like a photo in National Geographic.  Great colors and lighting.</td>', 'Definitely--looks like a photo in National Geographic.  Great colors and lighting.', '2004-10-11 21:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(955028, 111497, 21034, '<td valign="top">The overall effect is great. I''m not convinced with the composition, though.</td>', 'The overall effect is great. I''m not convinced with the composition, though.', '2004-10-11 21:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(955030, 111848, 21034, '<td valign="top">But we need to see more of them next time. Please. :)</td>', 'But we need to see more of them next time. Please. :)', '2004-10-11 21:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(955032, 111758, 21034, '<td valign="top">Wish his hair didn''t touch the top. Cool background Did you try a polarizing filter to kill the glare on his skin?</td>', 'Wish his hair didn''t touch the top. Cool background Did you try a polarizing filter to kill the glare on his skin?', '2004-10-11 21:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(955033, 111812, 21034, '<td valign="top">Cool colors. I''d like it better with an off-center composition and less glare on her eye.</td>', 'Cool colors. I''d like it better with an off-center composition and less glare on her eye.', '2004-10-11 21:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(955034, 111872, 21034, '<td valign="top">I like that you tried to convey a darker emotion, but there'' s too much overexposure, too little clear focus.</td>', 'I like that you tried to convey a darker emotion, but there'' s too much overexposure, too little clear focus.', '2004-10-11 21:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(955036, 111092, 25313, '<td valign="top">BEWILDERING! FINE FINE WORK</td>', 'BEWILDERING! FINE FINE WORK', '2004-10-11 21:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(955037, 111875, 21034, '<td valign="top">Cool idea. I found that the disconnect between his hand and his arm threw me off, though.</td>', 'Cool idea. I found that the disconnect between his hand and his arm threw me off, though.', '2004-10-11 21:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(955041, 111835, 25313, '<td valign="top">Courageous !</td>', 'Courageous !', '2004-10-11 21:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(955043, 111878, 21034, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea. Did you try moving the light around to get a more dramatic effect?</td>', 'Very nice idea. Did you try moving the light around to get a more dramatic effect?', '2004-10-11 21:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(955044, 111558, 25313, '<td valign="top">Cats meow!</td>', 'Cats meow!', '2004-10-11 21:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(955045, 111727, 21034, '<td valign="top">Crusty! Wow, how much did you sharpen this?</td>', 'Crusty! Wow, how much did you sharpen this?', '2004-10-11 21:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(955047, 111473, 21034, '<td valign="top">I can''t even type now.</td>', 'I can''t even type now.', '2004-10-11 21:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(955048, 111481, 21034, '<td valign="top">Great DOF. Background seems iffy, though.</td>', 'Great DOF. Background seems iffy, though.', '2004-10-11 21:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(955049, 111834, 25313, '<td valign="top">Horror or War?</td>', 'Horror or War?', '2004-10-11 21:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(955050, 111715, 21034, '<td valign="top">It seems to need more or less negative space.  Cool idea!</td>', 'It seems to need more or less negative space.  Cool idea!', '2004-10-11 21:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(955052, 111886, 21034, '<td valign="top">Wow, freakin'' cool tats!  Less shadow on the inside of the fist and I''d rate it higher.  That shadow kind of ruined the continuity for me.</td>', 'Wow, freakin'' cool tats!  Less shadow on the inside of the fist and I''d rate it higher.  That shadow kind of ruined the continuity for me.', '2004-10-11 21:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(955054, 111511, 21034, '<td valign="top">What the heck is that? A chicken bone?</td>', 'What the heck is that? A chicken bone?', '2004-10-11 21:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(955055, 111578, 21034, '<td valign="top">With an antenna up his nose. :)  Just kidding. But you know what I mean.</td>', 'With an antenna up his nose. :)  Just kidding. But you know what I mean.', '2004-10-11 21:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(955058, 111370, 21034, '<td valign="top">Great lighting!  A more dramatic composition might''ve added impact, but nicely executed.</td>', 'Great lighting!  A more dramatic composition might''ve added impact, but nicely executed.', '2004-10-11 21:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(955059, 111804, 25313, '<td valign="top">......but the feet!</td>', '......but the feet!', '2004-10-11 21:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(955061, 111481, 18080, '<td valign="top">Best on show IMHO<br/>10<br/>good luck<br/></td>', 'Best on show IMHO10good luck', '2004-10-11 21:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(955063, 111547, 18080, '<td valign="top">Great capture<br/>9<br/>good luck</td>', 'Great capture9good luck', '2004-10-11 21:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(955064, 110972, 18080, '<td valign="top">Great capture<br/>9<br/>good luck</td>', 'Great capture9good luck', '2004-10-11 21:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(955065, 111745, 25313, '<td valign="top">Evidence!</td>', 'Evidence!', '2004-10-11 21:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(955066, 111888, 18080, '<td valign="top">good shot<br/>8<br/>good luck<br/>beautiful skin tones</td>', 'good shot8good luckbeautiful skin tones', '2004-10-11 21:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(955067, 111693, 26756, '<td valign="top">I like the dof you chose for this picture and also the composition.  Can''t show this to my wife or she''ll hound me relentlessly for a cat.</td>', 'I like the dof you chose for this picture and also the composition.  Can''t show this to my wife or she''ll hound me relentlessly for a cat.', '2004-10-11 21:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(955074, 111812, 25313, '<td valign="top">enticing - salad!  I Love this shot.</td>', 'enticing - salad!  I Love this shot.', '2004-10-11 21:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(955076, 111705, 12813, '<td valign="top">great shot. great camere too.</td>', 'great shot. great camere too.', '2004-10-11 22:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(955077, 111481, 12813, '<td valign="top">beautiful.,graceful, unbelivable</td>', 'beautiful.,graceful, unbelivable', '2004-10-11 22:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(955079, 111586, 26045, '<td valign="top">Such great colors! (yes, and legs!) The simplicity really appeals to my senses, as does the style! I give it a ten!</td>', 'Such great colors! (yes, and legs!) The simplicity really appeals to my senses, as does the style! I give it a ten!', '2004-10-11 22:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(955082, 111809, 26045, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, but it''s a touch much on the surface of the wine and super neon of his silhouette...? Maybe? Regardless, love the tones of red, I give it a ten!</td>', 'Great lighting, but it''s a touch much on the surface of the wine and super neon of his silhouette...? Maybe? Regardless, love the tones of red, I give it a ten!', '2004-10-11 22:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(955084, 111812, 26045, '<td valign="top">Of all the eyes, I love this one the most. Hella vibrant, love the lashes, love the framing. I give it a ten!</td>', 'Of all the eyes, I love this one the most. Hella vibrant, love the lashes, love the framing. I give it a ten!', '2004-10-11 22:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(955089, 111727, 26045, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit much on the sharpness and contrast, but I know it''s all emphasized for a reason...I just love this shot. Would''ve liked to see more of the hardhat (?) and brick, because the colors are wonderful. Overall, I so dig this, and give it a nine.</td>', 'It''s a bit much on the sharpness and contrast, but I know it''s all emphasized for a reason...I just love this shot. Would''ve liked to see more of the hardhat (?) and brick, because the colors are wonderful. Overall, I so dig this, and give it a nine.', '2004-10-11 22:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(955092, 111876, 26045, '<td valign="top">Awesome! For a minute I wished the lower half of her face was more in focus, but the eyes...the eyes really pop! The blondish strand seemed alien to the rest, and the blurred/haloey strands over her nose is strange looking...those were both distracting, but the shot overall is kickass! I give it a nine.</td>', 'Awesome! For a minute I wished the lower half of her face was more in focus, but the eyes...the eyes really pop! The blondish strand seemed alien to the rest, and the blurred/haloey strands over her nose is strange looking...those were both distracting, but the shot overall is kickass! I give it a nine.', '2004-10-11 22:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(955097, 111473, 26045, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast and sharpness. I like this, it''s interesting and has great tones. And, yes, it''s one toned belly! 9 from me...</td>', 'Nice contrast and sharpness. I like this, it''s interesting and has great tones. And, yes, it''s one toned belly! 9 from me...', '2004-10-11 22:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(955098, 111886, 26045, '<td valign="top">I excepted so many tattoo shots, that''s why I didn''t do one myself!! But to see there''s only like...two tattoos shots! Argh! Anyway, this is a fantastic shot, very vibrant. It appeals to my senses, indeed. Maybe a more vibrant title to go along with it? Either way, I give it a 9.</td>', 'I excepted so many tattoo shots, that''s why I didn''t do one myself!! But to see there''s only like...two tattoos shots! Argh! Anyway, this is a fantastic shot, very vibrant. It appeals to my senses, indeed. Maybe a more vibrant title to go along with it? Either way, I give it a 9.', '2004-10-11 22:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(955100, 111715, 26045, '<td valign="top">Oh, Billy... This is way cool. A little much on the tips of the hair, some serious neon clashing where red hits white...but I really dig the ''do, and the shot. 9 from me...</td>', 'Oh, Billy... This is way cool. A little much on the tips of the hair, some serious neon clashing where red hits white...but I really dig the ''do, and the shot. 9 from me...', '2004-10-11 22:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(955102, 111388, 23478, '<td valign="top">Nice eyes and good focus.</td>', 'Nice eyes and good focus.', '2004-10-11 22:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(955103, 111886, 20115, '<td valign="top">Wow that''s amazing.</td>', 'Wow that''s amazing.', '2004-10-11 22:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(955104, 111797, 23478, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge.  Great focus and DOF.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge.  Great focus and DOF.', '2004-10-11 22:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(955105, 110172, 26045, '<td valign="top">Yay! This is so cool! I love this idea! In this contest, I''m leaning so much more towards personality and behavior, and less towards the physical...and this one really rocks the house! I love the sequence of her, but the far left ''her'' looks sooo different. I''m sure it''s intentional, but my eyes were hoping for similar lighting, that same edginess...Either way, I dig it. 9 from me...</td>', 'Yay! This is so cool! I love this idea! In this contest, I''m leaning so much more towards personality and behavior, and less towards the physical...and this one really rocks the house! I love the sequence of her, but the far left ''her'' looks sooo different. I''m sure it''s intentional, but my eyes were hoping for similar lighting, that same edginess...Either way, I dig it. 9 from me...', '2004-10-11 22:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
