(955188, 111758, 25464, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I really don''t like the choice of background.  This seems like a strange mix of elements.  I guess that may be the message conveyed about the person, but things just don''t seem to fit.  The background and the glasses make me think of a business suit environment which is very much out of place with the rest of the elements of the photo.  It leaves me feeling confused.</td>', 'Interesting.  I really don''t like the choice of background.  This seems like a strange mix of elements.  I guess that may be the message conveyed about the person, but things just don''t seem to fit.  The background and the glasses make me think of a business suit environment which is very much out of place with the rest of the elements of the photo.  It leaves me feeling confused.', '2004-10-11 23:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(955190, 111878, 25464, '<td valign="top">I like the tilted view, but the shot seems to be more about the piano than the fingers.  I think it would have been better if the hands had been in full view in the shot.</td>', 'I like the tilted view, but the shot seems to be more about the piano than the fingers.  I think it would have been better if the hands had been in full view in the shot.', '2004-10-11 23:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(955192, 110881, 25464, '<td valign="top">Good focus.  This shot doesn''t really convey trusty to me without the aid of the title, and the lines of the brows and nose keep drawing my eye to the nose instead of the eyes.  Hope thats helpful.  Pretty good.</td>', 'Good focus.  This shot doesn''t really convey trusty to me without the aid of the title, and the lines of the brows and nose keep drawing my eye to the nose instead of the eyes.  Hope thats helpful.  Pretty good.', '2004-10-11 23:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(955194, 111621, 25464, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo but a bit too snapshot like.  The focus is a bit off, and the feet are motion blurred.  IMO, I think this would have been better if she had been coming down the slide head first.  That way you could have made this a much tighter shot which would give more the impression of focusing on a feature, whether it be personality trait or physical trait, rather than the entire person.  Just a suggestion.</td>', 'This is a nice photo but a bit too snapshot like.  The focus is a bit off, and the feet are motion blurred.  IMO, I think this would have been better if she had been coming down the slide head first.  That way you could have made this a much tighter shot which would give more the impression of focusing on a feature, whether it be personality trait or physical trait, rather than the entire person.  Just a suggestion.', '2004-10-11 23:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(955195, 111370, 27835, '<td valign="top">nice  picture...i like it a lot....9</td>', 'nice  picture...i like it a lot....9', '2004-10-11 23:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
