(955200, 111886, 26756, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  The lighting is good, especially interesting at the hand.  Colors are vivid but to my eyes it seems like it could be a bit sharper. Either that or I''m losing my vision, either one.</td>', 'Nice photo.  The lighting is good, especially interesting at the hand.  Colors are vivid but to my eyes it seems like it could be a bit sharper. Either that or I''m losing my vision, either one.', '2004-10-11 23:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(955205, 111481, 25464, '<td valign="top">Interesting literal interpretation of the challenge.  A good shot, but I am distracted by the blurred portion in the upper right.  I also try to think about the usefulness of a shot past the limits of the challenge.  I really can''t imagine this on anyone''s walls.  Overall pretty good.</td>', 'Interesting literal interpretation of the challenge.  A good shot, but I am distracted by the blurred portion in the upper right.  I also try to think about the usefulness of a shot past the limits of the challenge.  I really can''t imagine this on anyone''s walls.  Overall pretty good.', '2004-10-11 23:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(955206, 111856, 20115, '<td valign="top">Is this a real person--the skin looks too perfect if that is possible.  There is also no reflection in the eyes either--which gives an unreal look.  It''s strange, makes me keep looking at it--not sure if I see passion, but it sure is interesting.</td>', 'Is this a real person--the skin looks too perfect if that is possible.  There is also no reflection in the eyes either--which gives an unreal look.  It''s strange, makes me keep looking at it--not sure if I see passion, but it sure is interesting.', '2004-10-11 23:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
