(955282, 111814, 21245, '<td valign="top">Really nice range of tones, I love the picture and the feeling in it.  I used to go to drum circles all the time, I haven''t been able to find one near where I live now, and I miss them.  the child watching the drum really draws you into the feel of the shot. 9 from me</td>', 'Really nice range of tones, I love the picture and the feeling in it.  I used to go to drum circles all the time, I haven''t been able to find one near where I live now, and I miss them.  the child watching the drum really draws you into the feel of the shot. 9 from me', '2004-10-12 02:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
