(955453, 111547, 26115, '<td valign="top">WOW<br/>thats pretty much all i have to say,,,, 10 would be my vote if i could vote for this challenge!<br/>this is an amazing image and deffinitely have to say congratulations.... the colours and focus is stunning!    for those who comment that there is too much glare within the eyes may be a tad correct by my opinion but i do believe that that also adds an interesting dimension and makes you try to formulate a story to explain it <br/>the left eye however looks a bit strange... like the sunrise past the cloth because of that glare and that might be better removing or reshooting so it is not present and is hidden behind the cloth however there is really not a darned thing i would really want to change... CONGRATS  :D</td>', 'WOWthats pretty much all i have to say,,,, 10 would be my vote if i could vote for this challenge!this is an amazing image and deffinitely have to say congratulations.... the colours and focus is stunning!    for those who comment that there is too much glare within the eyes may be a tad correct by my opinion but i do believe that that also adds an interesting dimension and makes you try to formulate a story to explain it the left eye however looks a bit strange... like the sunrise past the cloth because of that glare and that might be better removing or reshooting so it is not present and is hidden behind the cloth however there is really not a darned thing i would really want to change... CONGRATS  :D', '2004-10-12 08:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
