(955492, 111547, 24666, '<td valign="top">Nice picture , nice colours , pity both eyes were not fully visible.</td>', 'Nice picture , nice colours , pity both eyes were not fully visible.', '2004-10-12 09:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(955493, 111388, 24666, '<td valign="top">Like the soft look and subtle colouring, one of my favourites.</td>', 'Like the soft look and subtle colouring, one of my favourites.', '2004-10-12 09:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(955494, 110172, 24666, '<td valign="top">Nice idea , would probably have cropped using just the three figures on the left , still a good picture.</td>', 'Nice idea , would probably have cropped using just the three figures on the left , still a good picture.', '2004-10-12 09:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(955495, 111586, 24666, '<td valign="top">Always a sucker for a good pair of legs ,</td>', 'Always a sucker for a good pair of legs ,', '2004-10-12 09:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(955504, 111484, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the B&amp;W tones and the wide angle look,  but I find the lighting too harsh. I don''t really like the dark shadow on the right side of the face.  Also, wish the background were blurred to avoid distraction.</td>', 'I like the B&W tones and the wide angle look,  but I find the lighting too harsh. I don''t really like the dark shadow on the right side of the face.  Also, wish the background were blurred to avoid distraction.', '2004-10-12 09:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(955538, 111558, 23912, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful picture. I had a hard time telling if the figure was a real image or a statue, which to me says, extremely well done on defining the feature. Were the eyes digitally enhanced? If not, beautiful figure you have captured! Beautiful!</td>', 'This is a beautiful picture. I had a hard time telling if the figure was a real image or a statue, which to me says, extremely well done on defining the feature. Were the eyes digitally enhanced? If not, beautiful figure you have captured! Beautiful!', '2004-10-12 10:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(955539, 111547, 23912, '<td valign="top">Many shots of eyes on this challenge, but none actually "speak" like this one does.You have captured beauty,innocence, and story all in these eyes! 10!</td>', 'Many shots of eyes on this challenge, but none actually "speak" like this one does.You have captured beauty,innocence, and story all in these eyes! 10!', '2004-10-12 10:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(955543, 111342, 23912, '<td valign="top">Ahh the most defining feature of a plumber! My hubby has a carpenter''s crack, and yes it is just as defining. The b/w lends to the reality of the challenge, and FINALLY something other than eyes. Very creative!</td>', 'Ahh the most defining feature of a plumber! My hubby has a carpenter''s crack, and yes it is just as defining. The b/w lends to the reality of the challenge, and FINALLY something other than eyes. Very creative!', '2004-10-12 10:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(955547, 111740, 23912, '<td valign="top">And what great defining dimples they are! Although I bet the goatee defines him also! Very handsome shot! Finally something other than eyes!</td>', 'And what great defining dimples they are! Although I bet the goatee defines him also! Very handsome shot! Finally something other than eyes!', '2004-10-12 10:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(955551, 111739, 2337, '<td valign="top">Well shot portrait of a fine Irish lass :)</td>', 'Well shot portrait of a fine Irish lass :)', '2004-10-12 10:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(955553, 111220, 26045, '<td valign="top">What a great idea! Kudos!</td>', 'What a great idea! Kudos!', '2004-10-12 10:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(955554, 111876, 2337, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of dof!!  Haunting shot!  Great job</td>', 'Excellent use of dof!!  Haunting shot!  Great job', '2004-10-12 10:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(955555, 111342, 2337, '<td valign="top">LoL!  Humor and good execution :)</td>', 'LoL!  Humor and good execution :)', '2004-10-12 10:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(955558, 111388, 2337, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait!!! the background draws the viewer directly to the eyes.  Congrats</td>', 'Excellent portrait!!! the background draws the viewer directly to the eyes.  Congrats', '2004-10-12 10:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(955560, 111447, 2337, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  My only nitpick is the gentleman in the background is a bit distracting... If you could have blurred him out with a shallow dof, I think this shot would have been a lot better.<br/> <br/>But that''s just me... and what do I know :)</td>', 'Nice shot.  My only nitpick is the gentleman in the background is a bit distracting... If you could have blurred him out with a shallow dof, I think this shot would have been a lot better. But that''s just me... and what do I know :)', '2004-10-12 11:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(955562, 111762, 6667, '<td valign="top">Now what  kind of score do you think you are going to get from a Brown''s fan?!  Actually. . . a very good one.  Very nicely done.   Yo deserved the game too (although it hurts to say that)! 8</td>', 'Now what  kind of score do you think you are going to get from a Brown''s fan?!  Actually. . . a very good one.  Very nicely done.   Yo deserved the game too (although it hurts to say that)! 8', '2004-10-12 11:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(955565, 111571, 6667, '<td valign="top">Let me guess. . . this is going to get a Blue ribbon!!!  Wow  BOL</td>', 'Let me guess. . . this is going to get a Blue ribbon!!!  Wow  BOL', '2004-10-12 11:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(955632, 111743, 6532, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a bit too harsh.</td>', 'Lighting is a bit too harsh.', '2004-10-12 12:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(955636, 111874, 6532, '<td valign="top">The upside presentation is ok....it is the awkward placement of the eyes in the composition that bothers me.  Makes it difficult to view.  I know you were probabl trying to be different in this challenge - I think a different presentation of the eyes would have been more effective.</td>', 'The upside presentation is ok....it is the awkward placement of the eyes in the composition that bothers me.  Makes it difficult to view.  I know you were probabl trying to be different in this challenge - I think a different presentation of the eyes would have been more effective.', '2004-10-12 12:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(955639, 110957, 6532, '<td valign="top">I like this but ... the right side of the pic were the background is different is disrupting.</td>', 'I like this but ... the right side of the pic were the background is different is disrupting.', '2004-10-12 12:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(955642, 111612, 6532, '<td valign="top">Good dof.</td>', 'Good dof.', '2004-10-12 12:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(955646, 111872, 6532, '<td valign="top">The eyes seems out of focus.  The highlight on the cheek is also  bothersome for this light foreground.</td>', 'The eyes seems out of focus.  The highlight on the cheek is also  bothersome for this light foreground.', '2004-10-12 12:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(955647, 110501, 6532, '<td valign="top">I find myself trying to see the other eye - The title suggests that I should....</td>', 'I find myself trying to see the other eye - The title suggests that I should....', '2004-10-12 12:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(955649, 111397, 6532, '<td valign="top">Lighting is too much.  Nice composition.</td>', 'Lighting is too much.  Nice composition.', '2004-10-12 12:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(955718, 111754, 5822, '<td valign="top">I love the concept and lighting here, but I think the focus should be on the baby''s eyes, and not the booties.. Nicely done.</td>', 'I love the concept and lighting here, but I think the focus should be on the baby''s eyes, and not the booties.. Nicely done.', '2004-10-12 13:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(955740, 111726, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the composition but think it should have been flipped horizontally so that the line created between hand, glass and nose proceed from lower left to upper right. Lighting is not particularly attractive, especially with the tones created on the skin.</td>', 'I like the composition but think it should have been flipped horizontally so that the line created between hand, glass and nose proceed from lower left to upper right. Lighting is not particularly attractive, especially with the tones created on the skin.', '2004-10-12 13:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(955759, 111686, 5822, '<td valign="top">Excellent photograph! She''s very cute with a wonderfully engaging smile. Exposure is right on with excellent skin tones and good catchlight in the eyes. Great job!</td>', 'Excellent photograph! She''s very cute with a wonderfully engaging smile. Exposure is right on with excellent skin tones and good catchlight in the eyes. Great job!', '2004-10-12 13:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(955770, 111801, 5822, '<td valign="top">The red of her hair is certainly vibrant,  but I think you should have given that more attention and more space in the image, as right now, it seems that the eyes are the most attention getting.  Yet, there''s something weird looking about her left eye (not sure what that is, though). Also, I don''t like the bleached look of the skin around the eyes and forehead as it has no detail.</td>', 'The red of her hair is certainly vibrant,  but I think you should have given that more attention and more space in the image, as right now, it seems that the eyes are the most attention getting.  Yet, there''s something weird looking about her left eye (not sure what that is, though). Also, I don''t like the bleached look of the skin around the eyes and forehead as it has no detail.', '2004-10-12 13:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(955794, 111758, 7778, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, exotic subject, a little too dark, perhaps, in the shadowed areas for all the intracate detail to be thoroughly enjoyed. The crop, especially, on top of the image is, unfortunately, intersecting part of the subject.<br/> <br/>What counts is there, captured and delivered without much discernible technical attention to artistic potential. The subject''s relaxed, cooperative pose contradicts the snapshot-like manner. A manner more considerately exposed and composed, IMO, would have matched the immense interest offered by the subject and, thus, would have made for a truly stunning capture, instead of a ''good'' one.</td>', 'Wonderful, exotic subject, a little too dark, perhaps, in the shadowed areas for all the intracate detail to be thoroughly enjoyed. The crop, especially, on top of the image is, unfortunately, intersecting part of the subject. What counts is there, captured and delivered without much discernible technical attention to artistic potential. The subject''s relaxed, cooperative pose contradicts the snapshot-like manner. A manner more considerately exposed and composed, IMO, would have matched the immense interest offered by the subject and, thus, would have made for a truly stunning capture, instead of a ''good'' one.', '2004-10-12 14:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(955828, 111621, 6532, '<td valign="top">Nice picture - however, the blur of the feet is distracting.</td>', 'Nice picture - however, the blur of the feet is distracting.', '2004-10-12 14:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(955829, 110484, 6532, '<td valign="top">Great smile and glow but the metal strip she is leaning on is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Great smile and glow but the metal strip she is leaning on is a bit distracting.', '2004-10-12 14:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(955834, 111789, 6532, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit blurry.  I like framing but I think this one is too much.</td>', 'Seems a bit blurry.  I like framing but I think this one is too much.', '2004-10-12 14:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(955838, 111687, 24715, '<td valign="top">Ha! It''s just great! Besides a novel idea, great colors and composition!</td>', 'Ha! It''s just great! Besides a novel idea, great colors and composition!', '2004-10-12 14:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(955840, 111342, 24715, '<td valign="top">Definitely an approach from the other end!</td>', 'Definitely an approach from the other end!', '2004-10-12 14:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(955875, 111571, 20779, '<td valign="top">Just about fell over when I saw this for the first time, and every time since. I can''t even begin to describe how beautiful this is, and I am not one to gravitate to portraits - child or adult. And those eyes!</td>', 'Just about fell over when I saw this for the first time, and every time since. I can''t even begin to describe how beautiful this is, and I am not one to gravitate to portraits - child or adult. And those eyes!', '2004-10-12 15:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(955878, 111547, 20779, '<td valign="top">Incredibly soulful and beautifully framed.</td>', 'Incredibly soulful and beautifully framed.', '2004-10-12 15:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(955879, 111728, 20779, '<td valign="top">Simply stunning.</td>', 'Simply stunning.', '2004-10-12 15:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(955881, 111856, 20779, '<td valign="top">One of the top "eye" photos I have EVER seen. I love the beautiful softness kept, also.</td>', 'One of the top "eye" photos I have EVER seen. I love the beautiful softness kept, also.', '2004-10-12 15:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(955882, 111589, 20779, '<td valign="top">Extremely dynamic and emotive.</td>', 'Extremely dynamic and emotive.', '2004-10-12 15:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(955883, 111493, 20779, '<td valign="top">Perfectly executed in every way.</td>', 'Perfectly executed in every way.', '2004-10-12 15:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(955884, 111621, 20779, '<td valign="top">You portrayed your title perfectly.</td>', 'You portrayed your title perfectly.', '2004-10-12 15:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(955885, 111473, 20779, '<td valign="top">You''ll get plenty of hate mail now out of jealousy! LOL Seriously, extremely well done.</td>', 'You''ll get plenty of hate mail now out of jealousy! LOL Seriously, extremely well done.', '2004-10-12 15:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(955886, 111812, 20779, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites for this challenge.</td>', 'One of my favorites for this challenge.', '2004-10-12 15:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
