(956228, 111844, 22748, '<td valign="top">Dramatic. Very cool.<br/> <br/>Oh, I thought I''d share what I found out about ''Je ne sais quoi'' in case anyone else out there doesn''t speak French:<br/> <br/>je ne sais quoi<br/> <br/>/zhuh nuh say KWAH/ That little something; a quality that eludes description: The Mona Lisas smile has a certain je ne sais quoi. From French, meaning I dont know what.<br/> <br/>The New Dictionary of Cultural Literacy, Third Edition.</td>', 'Dramatic. Very cool. Oh, I thought I''d share what I found out about ''Je ne sais quoi'' in case anyone else out there doesn''t speak French: je ne sais quoi /zhuh nuh say KWAH/ That little something; a quality that eludes description: The Mona Lisas smile has a certain je ne sais quoi. From French, meaning I dont know what. The New Dictionary of Cultural Literacy, Third Edition.', '2004-10-12 20:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
