(956615, 111686, 7778, '<td valign="top">Simple fun, a little frivolous, but well executed. The only ''evil'' part of this image are a few pronounced highlights reflected from (what else but) the horns. The composition is perfect, the uniformly white background very apt.<br/> <br/>The mood is light and the image infectously entertaining.</td>', 'Simple fun, a little frivolous, but well executed. The only ''evil'' part of this image are a few pronounced highlights reflected from (what else but) the horns. The composition is perfect, the uniformly white background very apt. The mood is light and the image infectously entertaining.', '2004-10-13 00:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(956619, 111894, 27771, '<td valign="top">mixed media in art, too confusing, poetry is mixed with photography and it confuses the viewer...(perhaps you want to write, but do not feel okay to publish writing as freely as you do your photography? I may be prying to deep here, but try searching poetry contests online if you haven''t already, you might enjoy it! :)  maybe looking to deeply, but the point here is that the photograph is neglected because the reading of the writing takes the stage, and if its a surname by which you write, you neglect the writer in you, even worse!</td>', 'mixed media in art, too confusing, poetry is mixed with photography and it confuses the viewer...(perhaps you want to write, but do not feel okay to publish writing as freely as you do your photography? I may be prying to deep here, but try searching poetry contests online if you haven''t already, you might enjoy it! :)  maybe looking to deeply, but the point here is that the photograph is neglected because the reading of the writing takes the stage, and if its a surname by which you write, you neglect the writer in you, even worse!', '2004-10-13 00:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(956624, 111254, 27771, '<td valign="top">interesting shot, I may have cropped down to just above the collar and focused on the pattern of the hair, but I also enjoy the logo on the shirt. good frame, good b&amp;w balance</td>', 'interesting shot, I may have cropped down to just above the collar and focused on the pattern of the hair, but I also enjoy the logo on the shirt. good frame, good b&w balance', '2004-10-13 00:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(956632, 111875, 27771, '<td valign="top">honestly, this one takes some time to identify the subject matter, not that this is a bad thing in itself, but it is good only when the ''discovered'' subject matter is either abstract (ie, there is no discovery and one looks inward) or surprising and captivating to the viewer.  bluntly, this is not surprising or captivating. but you did capture a mood, which is more important and more difficult to create.  The problem I have with this is that there are three focal points, the sleeve, the fingers, and the ashtray.  Take one of them out by cropping and you have a good shot.  LOVE...and I mean LOVE the dark black shadows, keep those up because not a lot of people here do those well.  those are really good.</td>', 'honestly, this one takes some time to identify the subject matter, not that this is a bad thing in itself, but it is good only when the ''discovered'' subject matter is either abstract (ie, there is no discovery and one looks inward) or surprising and captivating to the viewer.  bluntly, this is not surprising or captivating. but you did capture a mood, which is more important and more difficult to create.  The problem I have with this is that there are three focal points, the sleeve, the fingers, and the ashtray.  Take one of them out by cropping and you have a good shot.  LOVE...and I mean LOVE the dark black shadows, keep those up because not a lot of people here do those well.  those are really good.', '2004-10-13 00:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(956644, 110172, 27771, '<td valign="top">hmm...two different girls? the left image has long hair...I like the tunnel and the multiple exposures bundled together give a sort of explosion feel that matches the left image. I would reshoot this, but alter the second image from the right.  It doesn''t seem consistent with this explosion to anger transition, and I think it confuses the explosion transition.</td>', 'hmm...two different girls? the left image has long hair...I like the tunnel and the multiple exposures bundled together give a sort of explosion feel that matches the left image. I would reshoot this, but alter the second image from the right.  It doesn''t seem consistent with this explosion to anger transition, and I think it confuses the explosion transition.', '2004-10-13 00:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(956662, 111364, 8624, '<td valign="top">the eyes look great but the rest of the image is pretty soft.</td>', 'the eyes look great but the rest of the image is pretty soft.', '2004-10-13 00:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(956664, 111814, 8624, '<td valign="top">pretty interesting looking guy. I would have preferred to see him looking into the camera. His expression also seems almost bored or distracted. The little boy however, is certainly entranced.</td>', 'pretty interesting looking guy. I would have preferred to see him looking into the camera. His expression also seems almost bored or distracted. The little boy however, is certainly entranced.', '2004-10-13 00:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
