(956669, 111321, 8624, '<td valign="top">I like the dramatic lighting and the funny expression. If you want me to focus on the lips, however, having the subject play with his hair this way is quite distracting.</td>', 'I like the dramatic lighting and the funny expression. If you want me to focus on the lips, however, having the subject play with his hair this way is quite distracting.', '2004-10-13 00:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
