(958089, 111809, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellent setup and lighting.  Perfect colors and sihlouette.  A minor point - since the nose was the main "subject" - it would have been great if the rim lighting were around the nose as well as the chin.  One of the top images in this cahllenge.</td>', 'Excellent setup and lighting.  Perfect colors and sihlouette.  A minor point - since the nose was the main "subject" - it would have been great if the rim lighting were around the nose as well as the chin.  One of the top images in this cahllenge.', '2004-10-13 16:31:27.000000', NULL, 1);
