(958106, 111138, 19608, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle.  The left eye is perfect, but the eye lashes make the right eye appear a bit unusual.  Border too strong.</td>', 'Interesting angle.  The left eye is perfect, but the eye lashes make the right eye appear a bit unusual.  Border too strong.', '2004-10-13 16:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
