(958142, 111876, 19608, '<td valign="top">Oh my.  I love this image a lot - but find the light brown string very out of place.  Soft focus is unusual but VERY EFFECTIVE for this out of the box portrait.</td>', 'Oh my.  I love this image a lot - but find the light brown string very out of place.  Soft focus is unusual but VERY EFFECTIVE for this out of the box portrait.', '2004-10-13 16:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
