(958154, 111883, 19608, '<td valign="top">I assume you mean Pony Tail - which is a very good defining feature.  The ultra white background detracts.</td>', 'I assume you mean Pony Tail - which is a very good defining feature.  The ultra white background detracts.', '2004-10-13 17:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
