(958538, 111894, 23478, '<td valign="top">The foto is great, as far as lighting and focus are concerned.  Bumping score to 8.</td>', 'The foto is great, as far as lighting and focus are concerned.  Bumping score to 8.', '2004-10-13 21:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(958617, 110881, 7485, '<td valign="top">Would have preferred either a tighter crop (just the eyes) or looser (the whole face)</td>', 'Would have preferred either a tighter crop (just the eyes) or looser (the whole face)', '2004-10-13 22:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(958620, 111727, 318, '<td valign="top">Way too much sharpening, a shame on a very good subject.</td>', 'Way too much sharpening, a shame on a very good subject.', '2004-10-13 22:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(958621, 111868, 7485, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and great detail in the skin. A little more contrast on the skin, maybe less flat light is the only improvement I can suggest - 7</td>', 'Excellent composition and great detail in the skin. A little more contrast on the skin, maybe less flat light is the only improvement I can suggest - 7', '2004-10-13 22:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(958623, 111684, 7485, '<td valign="top">Funny idea, but it looks like he''s staring above the flame</td>', 'Funny idea, but it looks like he''s staring above the flame', '2004-10-13 23:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(958626, 111765, 7485, '<td valign="top">Wish she were looking into the camera...</td>', 'Wish she were looking into the camera...', '2004-10-13 23:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(958630, 111333, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great idea! Just wish the perspective were slightly different, such that her face wasn''t overlapping the line behind her. Also, maybe a little more light on her face.</td>', 'Great idea! Just wish the perspective were slightly different, such that her face wasn''t overlapping the line behind her. Also, maybe a little more light on her face.', '2004-10-13 23:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(958634, 111481, 7485, '<td valign="top">Fabulous composition and use of shallow DOF - 8</td>', 'Fabulous composition and use of shallow DOF - 8', '2004-10-13 23:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(958638, 111844, 7485, '<td valign="top">The lack of sharpness doesn''t work for me, otherwise a very good composition and pose</td>', 'The lack of sharpness doesn''t work for me, otherwise a very good composition and pose', '2004-10-13 23:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(958639, 111571, 7485, '<td valign="top">There''s something faintly off-putting about the greenish-blue tint to the skin color of the upper face</td>', 'There''s something faintly off-putting about the greenish-blue tint to the skin color of the upper face', '2004-10-13 23:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(958641, 111847, 7485, '<td valign="top">The unbalanced lighting detracts from an otherwise good photo. The saturated sky doesn''t go with the dusk lighting on the girl.</td>', 'The unbalanced lighting detracts from an otherwise good photo. The saturated sky doesn''t go with the dusk lighting on the girl.', '2004-10-13 23:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(958643, 111547, 7485, '<td valign="top">The best of the ''eyes'' photos. It''s just amazing how they look like pools of obsidian - 10</td>', 'The best of the ''eyes'' photos. It''s just amazing how they look like pools of obsidian - 10', '2004-10-13 23:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(958646, 111727, 7485, '<td valign="top">Very well shot (lighting and composition), but too much sharpening in postprocessing - 7</td>', 'Very well shot (lighting and composition), but too much sharpening in postprocessing - 7', '2004-10-13 23:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(958652, 111815, 27341, '<td valign="top">that is awsome my frien has one of those</td>', 'that is awsome my frien has one of those', '2004-10-13 23:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(958690, 111691, 7485, '<td valign="top">Good idea and I think the harsh lighting works well, but I don''t like the lack of sharpness</td>', 'Good idea and I think the harsh lighting works well, but I don''t like the lack of sharpness', '2004-10-14 00:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(958692, 111586, 7485, '<td valign="top">Greaat use of color contrast!</td>', 'Greaat use of color contrast!', '2004-10-14 00:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(958699, 111878, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great idea, interesting composition, but the black keys are too gray. Try cropping the low end of the histogram using levels or curves, you''ll get an image with more impact.</td>', 'Great idea, interesting composition, but the black keys are too gray. Try cropping the low end of the histogram using levels or curves, you''ll get an image with more impact.', '2004-10-14 00:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(958703, 111856, 7485, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, it wasn''t the beauty of the eyes that I noticed first but the unnaturalness of the skin</td>', 'Unfortunately, it wasn''t the beauty of the eyes that I noticed first but the unnaturalness of the skin', '2004-10-14 00:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(958710, 111804, 7485, '<td valign="top">Very interesting pose! In fact, I''d like try this shot myself (my wife has very similar hair). One thing I might try different is to put less light on the feet and maybe backlight the hair to make it stand out more.</td>', 'Very interesting pose! In fact, I''d like try this shot myself (my wife has very similar hair). One thing I might try different is to put less light on the feet and maybe backlight the hair to make it stand out more.', '2004-10-14 00:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(958712, 111558, 10080, '<td valign="top">Very nice feeling! Good job..a bit soft, but I like portraits like that!</td>', 'Very nice feeling! Good job..a bit soft, but I like portraits like that!', '2004-10-14 00:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(958780, 111225, 18799, '<td valign="top">This is hilarious!  Even as a Nikon user (who, by the way, refuses to be drawn into the endless debates), I can see the humor in this photo.</td>', 'This is hilarious!  Even as a Nikon user (who, by the way, refuses to be drawn into the endless debates), I can see the humor in this photo.', '2004-10-14 01:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(958782, 111789, 18799, '<td valign="top">The compositon is great.  The soft focus may have been intentional, but if so, it''s a little too much for me.  6</td>', 'The compositon is great.  The soft focus may have been intentional, but if so, it''s a little too much for me.  6', '2004-10-14 01:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(958785, 111726, 18799, '<td valign="top">The desat doesn''t really work for me on this one.  Otherwise, it''s a well composed, overall technically good photograph</td>', 'The desat doesn''t really work for me on this one.  Otherwise, it''s a well composed, overall technically good photograph', '2004-10-14 01:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(958786, 111798, 18799, '<td valign="top">This is a really neat photo.  Technically, it''s a little over-exposed, but it made me smile none-the-less.</td>', 'This is a really neat photo.  Technically, it''s a little over-exposed, but it made me smile none-the-less.', '2004-10-14 01:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(958788, 111342, 18799, '<td valign="top">Yuck!!  But other than that, it meets the challenge very well and is technicaly good. 7</td>', 'Yuck!!  But other than that, it meets the challenge very well and is technicaly good. 7', '2004-10-14 01:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(958794, 111727, 18799, '<td valign="top">Good character photo.  It would have been more powerful if the DOF was a little shallower to put the bricks out of focus as I think they are a little distracting. 6</td>', 'Good character photo.  It would have been more powerful if the DOF was a little shallower to put the bricks out of focus as I think they are a little distracting. 6', '2004-10-14 01:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(958797, 111705, 18799, '<td valign="top">Nice idea with the reflected window.  Personally, the photos that are of only the eyes lose the personality of the person.  I would have liked to have seen more of the persons face.  Just MHO<br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'Nice idea with the reflected window.  Personally, the photos that are of only the eyes lose the personality of the person.  I would have liked to have seen more of the persons face.  Just MHO      ', '2004-10-14 01:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(958799, 111807, 18799, '<td valign="top">This would be a better photo with less shadows on the face.  Also, I think the crop is a little awkward.  5</td>', 'This would be a better photo with less shadows on the face.  Also, I think the crop is a little awkward.  5', '2004-10-14 01:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(958800, 111571, 18799, '<td valign="top">Very nice</td>', 'Very nice', '2004-10-14 01:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(958801, 111814, 18799, '<td valign="top">Very good, one of my favorites of the challenge   10</td>', 'Very good, one of my favorites of the challenge   10', '2004-10-14 01:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(958803, 111689, 18799, '<td valign="top">The vignette effect doesn''t work for me and the subject is a little out of focus.</td>', 'The vignette effect doesn''t work for me and the subject is a little out of focus.', '2004-10-14 01:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(958804, 111358, 18799, '<td valign="top">The eyes filling the frames in this challenge leave me wanting to see more.  By themselves, they don''t portray personality  IMO</td>', 'The eyes filling the frames in this challenge leave me wanting to see more.  By themselves, they don''t portray personality  IMO', '2004-10-14 01:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(958920, 111547, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful portrait - my favorite shot of this challenge. The colors, lighting and contrast are outstanding. Really great job.</td>', 'This is a beautiful portrait - my favorite shot of this challenge. The colors, lighting and contrast are outstanding. Really great job.', '2004-10-14 06:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(958921, 111493, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is an exceptionally well composed shot with excellent detail and contrast. Really nice job.</td>', 'This is an exceptionally well composed shot with excellent detail and contrast. Really nice job.', '2004-10-14 06:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(958922, 111481, 19952, '<td valign="top">You''re right - those eyelashes are an exceptional feature. And this shot of them came out great. Really nice job.</td>', 'You''re right - those eyelashes are an exceptional feature. And this shot of them came out great. Really nice job.', '2004-10-14 06:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(958925, 111728, 19952, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot of a beautiful subject. I love the composition, and the duotone with selective desat works well for this image. Really nice job.</td>', 'Beautiful shot of a beautiful subject. I love the composition, and the duotone with selective desat works well for this image. Really nice job.', '2004-10-14 06:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(958927, 111358, 19952, '<td valign="top">One of the best high key eye shots I''ve seen. You managed to maintain excellent color and detail in the eye itself, though a bit more lighting from below or from the side would remove that shadow across the top of the iris. Still, really nice job.</td>', 'One of the best high key eye shots I''ve seen. You managed to maintain excellent color and detail in the eye itself, though a bit more lighting from below or from the side would remove that shadow across the top of the iris. Still, really nice job.', '2004-10-14 06:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
