(960204, 111894, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and grainy appearance a lot but certain improvements, I feel could give it more impact. First,  what''s your keyboard doing in there???!!! Secondly, I would like to see more even lighting and possibly some fill light on top to illuminate the rock and top of the paper better.  Wish you had photographed this on some old antique desk or something.  Also, the color grain could be eliminated with a noise reduction program like Neat Image and would like to see the luminance grain left Good idea, but needs improvement.</td>', 'I like the composition and grainy appearance a lot but certain improvements, I feel could give it more impact. First,  what''s your keyboard doing in there???!!! Secondly, I would like to see more even lighting and possibly some fill light on top to illuminate the rock and top of the paper better.  Wish you had photographed this on some old antique desk or something.  Also, the color grain could be eliminated with a noise reduction program like Neat Image and would like to see the luminance grain left Good idea, but needs improvement.', '2004-10-15 00:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
