(960455, 111474, 2798, '<td valign="top">Focus is just a tiny bit too soft. It distracts from the lovely portrait. 7</td>', 'Focus is just a tiny bit too soft. It distracts from the lovely portrait. 7', '2004-10-15 07:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(960456, 111894, 2798, '<td valign="top">Very very grainy. Nice light. Not really a challenging photographic subject though. 6</td>', 'Very very grainy. Nice light. Not really a challenging photographic subject though. 6', '2004-10-15 08:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(960458, 111856, 2798, '<td valign="top">OMG - what have you done? Is this a painting or is it neat imaged to death? 6</td>', 'OMG - what have you done? Is this a painting or is it neat imaged to death? 6', '2004-10-15 08:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(960459, 111883, 2798, '<td valign="top">Looks overly post processed. Not sure about the crop. Good subject though. 6</td>', 'Looks overly post processed. Not sure about the crop. Good subject though. 6', '2004-10-15 08:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(960462, 111727, 2798, '<td valign="top">Great shot but it looks well over sharpened and that spoils the impact for me. 7</td>', 'Great shot but it looks well over sharpened and that spoils the impact for me. 7', '2004-10-15 08:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(960463, 111842, 2798, '<td valign="top">Great concept - bags of fun and character. Focus is just a touch soft and it could use a touch more contrast. 8</td>', 'Great concept - bags of fun and character. Focus is just a touch soft and it could use a touch more contrast. 8', '2004-10-15 08:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(960464, 111827, 2798, '<td valign="top">A touch of fill-in flash would have helped. Great photo otherwise. 7</td>', 'A touch of fill-in flash would have helped. Great photo otherwise. 7', '2004-10-15 08:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(960476, 111726, 2798, '<td valign="top">But that isn''t a whisky glass! Pointless use of desaturation. Good concept. 6</td>', 'But that isn''t a whisky glass! Pointless use of desaturation. Good concept. 6', '2004-10-15 08:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(960477, 111809, 2798, '<td valign="top">Love the background light. Very well executed. 9</td>', 'Love the background light. Very well executed. 9', '2004-10-15 08:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(960479, 111686, 2798, '<td valign="top">Good character and fun. Excellent portrait 8</td>', 'Good character and fun. Excellent portrait 8', '2004-10-15 08:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(960480, 110344, 2798, '<td valign="top">Fantastic sense of fun and character. Superb portrait. Just the slight lack of focus that stops it being a 10 for me. 9</td>', 'Fantastic sense of fun and character. Superb portrait. Just the slight lack of focus that stops it being a 10 for me. 9', '2004-10-15 08:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(960481, 111481, 2798, '<td valign="top">Lovely use of DoF and great composition. Well done 9</td>', 'Lovely use of DoF and great composition. Well done 9', '2004-10-15 08:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(960528, 110172, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun montage! Nice clarity with these darker images. The composition is especially effective and balanced. 9</td>', 'Fun montage! Nice clarity with these darker images. The composition is especially effective and balanced. 9', '2004-10-15 10:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(960577, 111876, 1368, '<td valign="top">YES!  fucking awesome ! :D</td>', 'YES!  fucking awesome ! :D', '2004-10-15 11:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(960580, 111547, 1368, '<td valign="top">I´m in love :D</td>', 'I´m in love :D', '2004-10-15 11:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(960583, 111497, 1368, '<td valign="top">Great stuff! love it :D</td>', 'Great stuff! love it :D', '2004-10-15 11:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(960589, 111851, 19982, '<td valign="top">It could be an optical illusion stemming from the tracks, but I think there may be a slight clockwise rotation here...  turn it back just a little and it would remove the distraction.  Other than that, I love the autumn colors and the depth of field.  The kid is cute too.  Good luck in the challenge!<br/></td>', 'It could be an optical illusion stemming from the tracks, but I think there may be a slight clockwise rotation here...  turn it back just a little and it would remove the distraction.  Other than that, I love the autumn colors and the depth of field.  The kid is cute too.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-10-15 11:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(960593, 111880, 19982, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a bit dark and out of focus...  I''d like to see the hands a little better to understand just what is so interesting about this person''s hands.</td>', 'Perhaps a bit dark and out of focus...  I''d like to see the hands a little better to understand just what is so interesting about this person''s hands.', '2004-10-15 11:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(960594, 111762, 19982, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp on the subject, good use of depth of field.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice and sharp on the subject, good use of depth of field.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-10-15 11:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(960595, 111789, 19982, '<td valign="top">It seems the strands of hair up to teh right are more in focus than her eyes and mouth.  Perhaps a little more depth of field or a little better focus would have helped.</td>', 'It seems the strands of hair up to teh right are more in focus than her eyes and mouth.  Perhaps a little more depth of field or a little better focus would have helped.', '2004-10-15 11:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(960597, 111547, 19982, '<td valign="top">Whoa...   National Geographic here you come!  Awesome picture, this one is going straight to the top of my list!  I haven''t seen the rest of the pictures yet, but if this doesn''t get the blue, it''s sure to be near the top!</td>', 'Whoa...   National Geographic here you come!  Awesome picture, this one is going straight to the top of my list!  I haven''t seen the rest of the pictures yet, but if this doesn''t get the blue, it''s sure to be near the top!', '2004-10-15 11:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(960680, 111875, 24925, '<td valign="top">I like it a lot, but I have a feeling this photo will get underrated...</td>', 'I like it a lot, but I have a feeling this photo will get underrated...', '2004-10-15 13:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(960683, 111687, 24925, '<td valign="top">Do this man thinking or are he just scared?</td>', 'Do this man thinking or are he just scared?', '2004-10-15 13:33:59.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(960685, 111556, 24925, '<td valign="top">I sure hope you got this person''s approval to post this photo.</td>', 'I sure hope you got this person''s approval to post this photo.', '2004-10-15 13:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(960692, 111876, 24925, '<td valign="top">This picture is incredible.  Great show of intensity!<br/> <br/>I don''t think it will win because of it''s lack of ''prettiness'', but it''s definitely in my top 3.</td>', 'This picture is incredible.  Great show of intensity! I don''t think it will win because of it''s lack of ''prettiness'', but it''s definitely in my top 3.', '2004-10-15 13:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(960767, 111547, 25143, '<td valign="top">very lovely</td>', 'very lovely', '2004-10-15 15:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(960824, 111558, 21034, '<td valign="top">Subtle, but so intense. What awesome work.</td>', 'Subtle, but so intense. What awesome work.', '2004-10-15 15:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(960868, 111254, 5286, '<td valign="top">Wondering why the background is grainy.. or is it just me?</td>', 'Wondering why the background is grainy.. or is it just me?', '2004-10-15 16:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(960870, 111874, 5286, '<td valign="top">Was this inverted accidentally?</td>', 'Was this inverted accidentally?', '2004-10-15 16:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(960872, 111571, 5286, '<td valign="top">The eyes are not sharp.. is there some camera shake here?</td>', 'The eyes are not sharp.. is there some camera shake here?', '2004-10-15 16:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(960873, 110484, 5286, '<td valign="top">I agree. There is definitely a glow :). <br/></td>', 'I agree. There is definitely a glow :). ', '2004-10-15 16:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(960874, 111693, 5286, '<td valign="top">Defining feature is nose, then why does the eye seem like the focus of the composition.. the eye is so much sharper than the nose, and more strategically placed as well.</td>', 'Defining feature is nose, then why does the eye seem like the focus of the composition.. the eye is so much sharper than the nose, and more strategically placed as well.', '2004-10-15 16:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(960876, 111884, 5286, '<td valign="top">not sharp.</td>', 'not sharp.', '2004-10-15 16:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(961107, 111481, 28035, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful. No questions asked.</td>', 'This is beautiful. No questions asked.', '2004-10-15 20:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(961154, 111842, 5822, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot with a cute sense of humor.  Very effective use of black and white. Good job.</td>', 'Wonderful shot with a cute sense of humor.  Very effective use of black and white. Good job.', '2004-10-15 21:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(961167, 111876, 12253, '<td valign="top">Great expression and DOF treatment.  I think you shuold stay away from her. ;)</td>', 'Great expression and DOF treatment.  I think you shuold stay away from her. ;)', '2004-10-15 21:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(961171, 111834, 5822, '<td valign="top">Composition and concept here is excellent. Really like it but the image could use some improvement in other areas, such as, exposure (too dark) and it looks a little soft to me.  Also, skin tones appear a bit too red to me.  Other than those issues, which can easily be fixed, this is a great photo! Well done on the composition.  9</td>', 'Composition and concept here is excellent. Really like it but the image could use some improvement in other areas, such as, exposure (too dark) and it looks a little soft to me.  Also, skin tones appear a bit too red to me.  Other than those issues, which can easily be fixed, this is a great photo! Well done on the composition.  9', '2004-10-15 21:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(961172, 111447, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nicely done; The only issue I see is the very bright light behind his head/hat.  I wish you had cloned that out.</td>', 'Nicely done; The only issue I see is the very bright light behind his head/hat.  I wish you had cloned that out.', '2004-10-15 21:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(961174, 111887, 12253, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I think it would have been a good idea to clone out the upper right corner structure.  Also, perhaps a darker shirt to focus us on the face.</td>', 'Very nice!  I think it would have been a good idea to clone out the upper right corner structure.  Also, perhaps a darker shirt to focus us on the face.', '2004-10-15 21:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(961176, 111586, 12253, '<td valign="top">I like the pose and the color contrasts.  I think it might have been nice to have some fill light under the chair to keep the yellow brightness even as sort of a natural backdrop.</td>', 'I like the pose and the color contrasts.  I think it might have been nice to have some fill light under the chair to keep the yellow brightness even as sort of a natural backdrop.', '2004-10-15 21:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(961179, 111547, 12253, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture.</td>', 'Wonderful capture.', '2004-10-15 21:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(961188, 111864, 5822, '<td valign="top">Funny look. Interesting subject, but it looks like you''ve cut his left arm off.  Eyes have no catchlights to give him some spark and life and I think the lighting is a bit too harsh.  If you''re going to go with a high-key brightness and just black and white as the colors, I would hope that you would get more detail and better color in the skin.  It appears a littel too blanched to me.</td>', 'Funny look. Interesting subject, but it looks like you''ve cut his left arm off.  Eyes have no catchlights to give him some spark and life and I think the lighting is a bit too harsh.  If you''re going to go with a high-key brightness and just black and white as the colors, I would hope that you would get more detail and better color in the skin.  It appears a littel too blanched to me.', '2004-10-15 21:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(961206, 111571, 5822, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous subject and priceless gaze with beautiful color but I think the eyes should be lighter.  Also, it looks as though you may have used a noise reduction program as there is very little detail in the skin.  Still scoring this highly. Very well done, despite the minor flaws. 9</td>', 'Gorgeous subject and priceless gaze with beautiful color but I think the eyes should be lighter.  Also, it looks as though you may have used a noise reduction program as there is very little detail in the skin.  Still scoring this highly. Very well done, despite the minor flaws. 9', '2004-10-15 21:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(961210, 111474, 5822, '<td valign="top">Good DOF and I like the capture alot, but think the eyes should be lighther with more detail showing.  Background, though blurred, still has some distracting hot spots that pull your attention away from your subject.</td>', 'Good DOF and I like the capture alot, but think the eyes should be lighther with more detail showing.  Background, though blurred, still has some distracting hot spots that pull your attention away from your subject.', '2004-10-15 21:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(961218, 111813, 5822, '<td valign="top">Interesting, sassy and attractive subject. I really like the the reds your subect is wearing against the black &amp; white striped background.  It appears, though, that the image is underexposed on my monitor, anyway, causing the reds to be subdued. Would like to see more pop in this photo.  Also, I find the foliage she''s standing on to be unattractive and doesn''t fit with the rest of the image.  Despite these flaws, thie composition is good and I can see this picture being used in some advertising circular.  8</td>', 'Interesting, sassy and attractive subject. I really like the the reds your subect is wearing against the black & white striped background.  It appears, though, that the image is underexposed on my monitor, anyway, causing the reds to be subdued. Would like to see more pop in this photo.  Also, I find the foliage she''s standing on to be unattractive and doesn''t fit with the rest of the image.  Despite these flaws, thie composition is good and I can see this picture being used in some advertising circular.  8', '2004-10-15 21:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(961229, 111814, 5822, '<td valign="top">Equisite tones and fascinating subects really push this up to the top of my ribbons list.  Focus is right on and this image is very compelling. Love the backlighting too. Very well done. 10</td>', 'Equisite tones and fascinating subects really push this up to the top of my ribbons list.  Focus is right on and this image is very compelling. Love the backlighting too. Very well done. 10', '2004-10-15 22:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(961230, 111789, 3306, '<td valign="top">A Very nice looking woman. Porcelain veneers would really enhance her smile.</td>', 'A Very nice looking woman. Porcelain veneers would really enhance her smile.', '2004-10-15 22:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(961268, 111842, 25464, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  What a good sport.  I could see this on a doggy calendar.</td>', 'Very cute.  What a good sport.  I could see this on a doggy calendar.', '2004-10-15 22:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(961274, 111589, 25464, '<td valign="top">This shot definitely captured the mood you were trying to convey, the composition, lighting, and expression are perfect.  It just looks like the focus landed on the neck instead of the face.  If the soft focus of the face was intentional, I don''t think it adds anything to the photo. Pretty good overall.</td>', 'This shot definitely captured the mood you were trying to convey, the composition, lighting, and expression are perfect.  It just looks like the focus landed on the neck instead of the face.  If the soft focus of the face was intentional, I don''t think it adds anything to the photo. Pretty good overall.', '2004-10-15 22:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(961276, 111721, 5822, '<td valign="top">Wonderful vibrant and compelling subject !  His smile and energy are infectious and make this image very compelling. You could just feel it looking at him.  What happened to your background, though??? I think you used too much flash. Try a slow synch flash to get the background, next time.   Well done! 8</td>', 'Wonderful vibrant and compelling subject !  His smile and energy are infectious and make this image very compelling. You could just feel it looking at him.  What happened to your background, though??? I think you used too much flash. Try a slow synch flash to get the background, next time.   Well done! 8', '2004-10-15 22:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(961279, 111225, 18191, '<td valign="top">One word...ten.</td>', 'One word...ten.', '2004-10-15 22:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(961281, 111844, 5822, '<td valign="top">Composition is good with the angle of her head and the way the hair sweeps but the color looks off and image is a bit on the soft side.  Catchlights are too conspicuous, imo and attract a lot of attention.</td>', 'Composition is good with the angle of her head and the way the hair sweeps but the color looks off and image is a bit on the soft side.  Catchlights are too conspicuous, imo and attract a lot of attention.', '2004-10-15 22:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(961282, 111705, 19982, '<td valign="top">There are lots of eye pictures.  What sets this one apart is the sharpness in the details.  Congratulations and good luck!</td>', 'There are lots of eye pictures.  What sets this one apart is the sharpness in the details.  Congratulations and good luck!', '2004-10-15 22:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(961292, 111813, 11738, '<td valign="top">I usually imagine a hip hop dancer in a more urban setting: the weedy growth just doesn''t seem to fit with the rest of the image for me.  Also gives the strange impression that she''s floating.  The metallic background is hard to define as well.  Lighting seems a tad harsh too.</td>', 'I usually imagine a hip hop dancer in a more urban setting: the weedy growth just doesn''t seem to fit with the rest of the image for me.  Also gives the strange impression that she''s floating.  The metallic background is hard to define as well.  Lighting seems a tad harsh too.', '2004-10-15 23:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(961297, 111497, 27842, '<td valign="top">Thought provoking shot.  Kind of frightening.</td>', 'Thought provoking shot.  Kind of frightening.', '2004-10-15 23:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(961298, 111851, 27842, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and colors.</td>', 'I really like the composition and colors.', '2004-10-15 23:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(961299, 111558, 27842, '<td valign="top">Very good and a bit haunting.</td>', 'Very good and a bit haunting.', '2004-10-15 23:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(961300, 111745, 27842, '<td valign="top">Excellent work</td>', 'Excellent work', '2004-10-15 23:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(961301, 111886, 27842, '<td valign="top">Interesting</td>', 'Interesting', '2004-10-15 23:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(961309, 111481, 19982, '<td valign="top">Love it!  So many of the "eye" pictures are out of focus.  This one is perfect.  And I love the angles .. created by the forhead, the eyelid, the lashes.  Well done.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Love it!  So many of the "eye" pictures are out of focus.  This one is perfect.  And I love the angles .. created by the forhead, the eyelid, the lashes.  Well done.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-10-15 23:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(961310, 111878, 19982, '<td valign="top">Good use of depth of field and angles!  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Good use of depth of field and angles!  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-10-15 23:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(961312, 111364, 19982, '<td valign="top">I love that you got a perfect focus on the eyes and still used shallow depth of field around the face.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I love that you got a perfect focus on the eyes and still used shallow depth of field around the face.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-10-15 23:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(961315, 110881, 19982, '<td valign="top">I can see that the eyebrows are in focus...  but the eyes appear a little soft.  Maybe a little more depth of field, or more focus on the eyes to improve the shot.</td>', 'I can see that the eyebrows are in focus...  but the eyes appear a little soft.  Maybe a little more depth of field, or more focus on the eyes to improve the shot.', '2004-10-15 23:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(961319, 111883, 12160, '<td valign="top">Focus is sharp and there''s a lot of nice textures for the eyes to feast on. I have a feeling and I could be wrong but this photo shows signs that it was underexposed and edited using the shadow/highlight adjustment feature. There are extreme halos around the edges and the skin color is a bit off. Perhaps severely cropped as well. Pls let me know if I was wrong and I''ll change my comment. :)</td>', 'Focus is sharp and there''s a lot of nice textures for the eyes to feast on. I have a feeling and I could be wrong but this photo shows signs that it was underexposed and edited using the shadow/highlight adjustment feature. There are extreme halos around the edges and the skin color is a bit off. Perhaps severely cropped as well. Pls let me know if I was wrong and I''ll change my comment. :)', '2004-10-15 23:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(961320, 111809, 19982, '<td valign="top">Lighting, angles, subject, all good.  Very well done!  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Lighting, angles, subject, all good.  Very well done!  Good luck in the challenge!', '2004-10-15 23:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(961323, 111370, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nice black and white. Good exposure and lighting. Technically well-done.</td>', 'Nice black and white. Good exposure and lighting. Technically well-done.', '2004-10-15 23:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(961326, 111434, 12160, '<td valign="top">Simple photo and I like that this was done in black and white. I do find my eyes focusing on the textured background instead of the hand.</td>', 'Simple photo and I like that this was done in black and white. I do find my eyes focusing on the textured background instead of the hand.', '2004-10-16 00:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(961336, 111547, 12160, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast in this photo. Good sharpness on the eyes and the tight crop is very effective. Marked as favorite. 10</td>', 'I love the contrast in this photo. Good sharpness on the eyes and the tight crop is very effective. Marked as favorite. 10', '2004-10-16 00:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(961347, 111687, 12160, '<td valign="top">LOL, great spoof. nice one! 7 for humor.</td>', 'LOL, great spoof. nice one! 7 for humor.', '2004-10-16 00:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(961352, 111587, 18799, '<td valign="top">Coming back for comments.  She does have a gorgeous grin.  I rated this photo a 5.  I think what makes me not rate it higher is the skin tones are kind of washed out.   Maybe she is naturally pale, if that''s the case, maybe a darker background would have helped tghe "wow" factor for this shot.</td>', 'Coming back for comments.  She does have a gorgeous grin.  I rated this photo a 5.  I think what makes me not rate it higher is the skin tones are kind of washed out.   Maybe she is naturally pale, if that''s the case, maybe a darker background would have helped tghe "wow" factor for this shot.', '2004-10-16 00:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(961355, 111389, 18799, '<td valign="top">A little more fill flash to brighten the faces a little more would have done wonders to elevate this picture from good to very good.</td>', 'A little more fill flash to brighten the faces a little more would have done wonders to elevate this picture from good to very good.', '2004-10-16 00:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(961356, 111547, 17851, '<td valign="top">lighting is exelent, color is awesome, and over all a beautiful image  (only thing that bothers me a bit is the eye on the left, maybe should have been completely covered?) but still  my top pick...good luck 10</td>', 'lighting is exelent, color is awesome, and over all a beautiful image  (only thing that bothers me a bit is the eye on the left, maybe should have been completely covered?) but still  my top pick...good luck 10', '2004-10-16 00:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(961363, 111801, 6804, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites in the challenge. The color, the style and the angle are all creative additions to the full work of art.   10</td>', 'This is one of my favorites in the challenge. The color, the style and the angle are all creative additions to the full work of art.   10', '2004-10-16 00:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(961374, 111484, 12962, '<td valign="top">ooops sorry, my comment didn''t register during the challenge ... it was ... what a bear!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-18 00:05:10.</i></td>', 'ooops sorry, my comment didn''t register during the challenge ... it was ... what a bear!', '2004-10-16 01:11:10.000000', '2004-10-18 01:05:10.000000', 1),
