(961885, 111232, 5822, '<td valign="top">Great photo! I think you''ve really captured the essence of grandmahood :).  Tones are excellent and I really hope this ribbons. 10 from me.</td>', 'Great photo! I think you''ve really captured the essence of grandmahood :).  Tones are excellent and I really hope this ribbons. 10 from me.', '2004-10-16 18:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(961891, 111493, 5822, '<td valign="top">I really like the sepia toning.  The plain concrete setting and off center positioning of the subject also help the photo to work for this model.</td>', 'I really like the sepia toning.  The plain concrete setting and off center positioning of the subject also help the photo to work for this model.', '2004-10-16 18:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(961901, 111797, 5822, '<td valign="top">Good thinking outside of the box.  I''m not crazy about the composition though, although I think the idea is really good.  The focal point of image seems to be where the pen tip, glasses and blank paper converge, but there is nothing there to see. Had you been able to have them converge on the boldface type of the word featuer in the dictionary, then I think it would have had more impact.  Also, I don''t really care for the color rendition and think B&amp;W would have worked better.  One more thing is that I would have liked to have seen the focal point rest on one of the intersections of the rule of thirds.</td>', 'Good thinking outside of the box.  I''m not crazy about the composition though, although I think the idea is really good.  The focal point of image seems to be where the pen tip, glasses and blank paper converge, but there is nothing there to see. Had you been able to have them converge on the boldface type of the word featuer in the dictionary, then I think it would have had more impact.  Also, I don''t really care for the color rendition and think B&W would have worked better.  One more thing is that I would have liked to have seen the focal point rest on one of the intersections of the rule of thirds.', '2004-10-16 18:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(961913, 111454, 5822, '<td valign="top">I think the background green compliments Sherry''s hair, more than it does her eyes and her expression seems quizzical, as though she''s wondering what you''re doing.  The lighting seems a bit too harsh and the shadow on the wall is deistracting.  Also, I don''t particulary care for the angle of view, and the slanted sofa in the background.  Gives a kind of bizarre appearance to the image.  Still, this pic is interesting, possibly because of what I discribed above.  I may come back to revise my critique.</td>', 'I think the background green compliments Sherry''s hair, more than it does her eyes and her expression seems quizzical, as though she''s wondering what you''re doing.  The lighting seems a bit too harsh and the shadow on the wall is deistracting.  Also, I don''t particulary care for the angle of view, and the slanted sofa in the background.  Gives a kind of bizarre appearance to the image.  Still, this pic is interesting, possibly because of what I discribed above.  I may come back to revise my critique.', '2004-10-16 18:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(961974, 111881, 5822, '<td valign="top">Composition is good but color seems to be off probably from incandescent lighting you used? Also, I don''t care for the shadows cast by the harsh lighting.</td>', 'Composition is good but color seems to be off probably from incandescent lighting you used? Also, I don''t care for the shadows cast by the harsh lighting.', '2004-10-16 20:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(961987, 111364, 23561, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. Lighting is just a little harsh IMO, but the composition and expression are great. 9</td>', 'Very nicely done. Lighting is just a little harsh IMO, but the composition and expression are great. 9', '2004-10-16 20:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(961990, 111876, 23561, '<td valign="top">I like the expression on the model and everything to the right of the string/blonde hair. The change in color tones, especially on the eyebrow, is a bit distracting IMO. Maybe a little too much green saturation? Composition and lighting are excellent. 8</td>', 'I like the expression on the model and everything to the right of the string/blonde hair. The change in color tones, especially on the eyebrow, is a bit distracting IMO. Maybe a little too much green saturation? Composition and lighting are excellent. 8', '2004-10-16 20:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(961994, 111434, 7733, '<td valign="top">dot?</td>', 'dot?', '2004-10-16 20:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(962005, 111686, 10402, '<td valign="top">The attitude shows even without the horns. Great capture. Eliminating the glare would improve the photo.</td>', 'The attitude shows even without the horns. Great capture. Eliminating the glare would improve the photo.', '2004-10-16 21:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(962010, 111873, 10402, '<td valign="top">The low viewpoint is a good idea and conveys the message of "tallness". But I think it is a bit overdone. Shooting with the camera a bit higher and further back (but zoomed in to keep her the same size) would still portray her as tall, but the exaggeration would be more subtle and the overall photo more attractive.</td>', 'The low viewpoint is a good idea and conveys the message of "tallness". But I think it is a bit overdone. Shooting with the camera a bit higher and further back (but zoomed in to keep her the same size) would still portray her as tall, but the exaggeration would be more subtle and the overall photo more attractive.', '2004-10-16 21:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(962011, 111878, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great approach, but the fingers are crowded too close to the top of the frame; a bit less piano and more hand would have worked better I think.</td>', 'Great approach, but the fingers are crowded too close to the top of the frame; a bit less piano and more hand would have worked better I think.', '2004-10-16 21:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(962021, 111484, 10402, '<td valign="top">Good concept, with a pose, shooting angle, and composition that work well. Lighting is too harsh; more specifically, the shadowed side of his face is too dark in comparison to the sunlit side. A reflector or maybe even a fill flash would have helped reduce the contrast.</td>', 'Good concept, with a pose, shooting angle, and composition that work well. Lighting is too harsh; more specifically, the shadowed side of his face is too dark in comparison to the sunlit side. A reflector or maybe even a fill flash would have helped reduce the contrast.', '2004-10-16 21:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(962025, 111804, 24183, '<td valign="top">great lighting</td>', 'great lighting', '2004-10-16 22:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(962026, 111880, 10402, '<td valign="top">Although a good idea, this interpretation isn''t very compelling. It''s too dark, so the interesting details of the hands'' surfaces are obscured. Including some context in the background would have also added interest (for example, his woodshop with tools or works in progress showing, or a newly framed house).</td>', 'Although a good idea, this interpretation isn''t very compelling. It''s too dark, so the interesting details of the hands'' surfaces are obscured. Including some context in the background would have also added interest (for example, his woodshop with tools or works in progress showing, or a newly framed house).', '2004-10-16 22:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(962028, 111851, 24183, '<td valign="top">great lines.  and colors.  everything really works well together here.  Great photo<br/></td>', 'great lines.  and colors.  everything really works well together here.  Great photo', '2004-10-16 22:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(962030, 111851, 10402, '<td valign="top">A vertical format and closer crop would show his cuteness better.</td>', 'A vertical format and closer crop would show his cuteness better.', '2004-10-16 22:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(962037, 111715, 10402, '<td valign="top">The white negative space works great, but I think some of the model''s forehead should be included. Maybe even the eyes, although that would be an entirely different photo.</td>', 'The white negative space works great, but I think some of the model''s forehead should be included. Maybe even the eyes, although that would be an entirely different photo.', '2004-10-16 22:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(962040, 111888, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great expression, and the white hood and black background work well with the model''s dark skin. Needs more DOF; even though the intent is to emphasize the cheeks, the eyes really need to be in focus.</td>', 'Great expression, and the white hood and black background work well with the model''s dark skin. Needs more DOF; even though the intent is to emphasize the cheeks, the eyes really need to be in focus.', '2004-10-16 22:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(962042, 110484, 10402, '<td valign="top">Her glow is nicely captured. The metal bar in background glows even more and is very distracting.</td>', 'Her glow is nicely captured. The metal bar in background glows even more and is very distracting.', '2004-10-16 22:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(962052, 111571, 10402, '<td valign="top">The close-up is nice, but the eyes at least need to be sharper. The rest of the face isn''t quite as important, but I like to see some detail. The only textures here seem to be compression artifacts. Overuse of the trial version of NeatImage perhaps?</td>', 'The close-up is nice, but the eyes at least need to be sharper. The rest of the face isn''t quite as important, but I like to see some detail. The only textures here seem to be compression artifacts. Overuse of the trial version of NeatImage perhaps?', '2004-10-16 22:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(962063, 110957, 19035, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and the serious expressions on there faces - good job.  9</td>', 'I love the colors and the serious expressions on there faces - good job.  9', '2004-10-16 22:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
