(963090, 110172, 6771, '<td valign="top">Nice multiple flash work.  Not sure if it is on purpose with the 2 in front being more in focus, and the back 2 less, but I like it that way.  Like that is the less noticeable aspect of the personality.  Lots of calls for focus throughout?  (C:  The left being cut off is mildly distracting.</td>', 'Nice multiple flash work.  Not sure if it is on purpose with the 2 in front being more in focus, and the back 2 less, but I like it that way.  Like that is the less noticeable aspect of the personality.  Lots of calls for focus throughout?  (C:  The left being cut off is mildly distracting.', '2004-10-17 22:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
