(963102, 111342, 6771, '<td valign="top">But this is the STYLE, yahno, homey.  I HATE THIS!!  The photo has good focus and lighting, but those crappy pants and kids wearing them...arrrggggghhh.  WHen I worked landscaping we would drop sand and pencils in guys cracks like this.  (C:   If I were voting you would get a 6 from me for this.</td>', 'But this is the STYLE, yahno, homey.  I HATE THIS!!  The photo has good focus and lighting, but those crappy pants and kids wearing them...arrrggggghhh.  WHen I worked landscaping we would drop sand and pencils in guys cracks like this.  (C:   If I were voting you would get a 6 from me for this.', '2004-10-17 23:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(963104, 111894, 6870, '<td valign="top">Interesting and effective set of symbolic images for this still life.</td>', 'Interesting and effective set of symbolic images for this still life.', '2004-10-17 23:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(963105, 111254, 22734, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments.<br/>A good defining feature very well photographed and great use of b/w Bumping up.</td>', 'Returning for comments.A good defining feature very well photographed and great use of b/w Bumping up.', '2004-10-17 23:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(963106, 111092, 6870, '<td valign="top">Do you remember when we used to sing ''Tra la la la la la la la la la tee da?'' Lovely image, wonderful expression and pose. She should love this! 8</td>', 'Do you remember when we used to sing ''Tra la la la la la la la la la tee da?'' Lovely image, wonderful expression and pose. She should love this! 8', '2004-10-17 23:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(963107, 111886, 22734, '<td valign="top">Returning for comments.<br/>Very defining and with no doubt. I would have liked a better lit subject, but bumping up on the sheer strength of the colors.</td>', 'Returning for comments.Very defining and with no doubt. I would have liked a better lit subject, but bumping up on the sheer strength of the colors.', '2004-10-17 23:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(963110, 111809, 6870, '<td valign="top">Yeah, this works. I don''t drink, but I still understand what''s going on here with your clear storytelling and wonderful use of sillhouette and color. Wonderful cropping, too. 9</td>', 'Yeah, this works. I don''t drink, but I still understand what''s going on here with your clear storytelling and wonderful use of sillhouette and color. Wonderful cropping, too. 9', '2004-10-17 23:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(963111, 111481, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like your shallow depth of field here, as it implies to me that the eyelashes  just keep on going. Nice, bright image. 9</td>', 'I like your shallow depth of field here, as it implies to me that the eyelashes  just keep on going. Nice, bright image. 9', '2004-10-17 23:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(963113, 111497, 6870, '<td valign="top">Really cool light and focus. Framing him with grass hardens his edges a bit and makes this quite effective! 9</td>', 'Really cool light and focus. Framing him with grass hardens his edges a bit and makes this quite effective! 9', '2004-10-17 23:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(963118, 111689, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice expression and pose. I''m not sure your sepia communicates much or enhances your communication much, though.</td>', 'Nice expression and pose. I''m not sure your sepia communicates much or enhances your communication much, though.', '2004-10-17 23:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(963120, 111743, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and point of view. I like the lighting, though it may be interesting to try this with the hand lit as well to avoid that dark spot. Still, I like it.</td>', 'Nice angle and point of view. I like the lighting, though it may be interesting to try this with the hand lit as well to avoid that dark spot. Still, I like it.', '2004-10-17 23:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(963123, 111813, 6870, '<td valign="top">Do they wear plaid in Wyoming? I like the background here, and the darker tones appeal to me and match her expression.</td>', 'Do they wear plaid in Wyoming? I like the background here, and the darker tones appeal to me and match her expression.', '2004-10-17 23:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(963128, 111884, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lovely point of view here. But how I wish that both eyes were in focus. I like your lighting here, too.</td>', 'Lovely point of view here. But how I wish that both eyes were in focus. I like your lighting here, too.', '2004-10-17 23:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(963129, 111728, 6870, '<td valign="top">Well, I finally found my own favorite for this challenge! Very nice work. Effective composition and juxtaposition between innocence and the trapped feeling from the ropes. The eye color adds to the feel of innocence, too. Marvelous work! 10</td>', 'Well, I finally found my own favorite for this challenge! Very nice work. Effective composition and juxtaposition between innocence and the trapped feeling from the ropes. The eye color adds to the feel of innocence, too. Marvelous work! 10', '2004-10-17 23:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(963134, 111721, 6870, '<td valign="top">He does indeed have a bright smile! I''m not sure what the weirdness is behind him though. Did you select that area and darken it? It kind of upstages your good work in front.</td>', 'He does indeed have a bright smile! I''m not sure what the weirdness is behind him though. Did you select that area and darken it? It kind of upstages your good work in front.', '2004-10-17 23:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(963137, 111547, 22975, '<td valign="top">This is my absolute, hands-down, no-doubt-about-it FAVORITE in this challenge.  This is a wonderful capture of a beautiful girl.  The colors are perfect, so fabulously saturated... I really can''t say enough about how great this shot is.  I really think you''ll get the blue, and if you don''t, then you will have been ROBBED!  :)</td>', 'This is my absolute, hands-down, no-doubt-about-it FAVORITE in this challenge.  This is a wonderful capture of a beautiful girl.  The colors are perfect, so fabulously saturated... I really can''t say enough about how great this shot is.  I really think you''ll get the blue, and if you don''t, then you will have been ROBBED!  :)', '2004-10-17 23:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(963138, 111844, 6870, '<td valign="top">Marvelous post and poitn of view, and wonderfully close up. Expression is fantastic! I do wish it were in focus, though.</td>', 'Marvelous post and poitn of view, and wonderfully close up. Expression is fantastic! I do wish it were in focus, though.', '2004-10-17 23:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(963140, 111589, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice expression here, and the lighting adds strength to her. Dividing her in half, though weakens her, in my view. She is only half there, so only half as strong. The negative space invites doubt as to her stubbornness. Still, nice piercing gaze.</td>', 'Nice expression here, and the lighting adds strength to her. Dividing her in half, though weakens her, in my view. She is only half there, so only half as strong. The negative space invites doubt as to her stubbornness. Still, nice piercing gaze.', '2004-10-17 23:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(963142, 111880, 6870, '<td valign="top">Quite dark here, and perhaps these hands could use a few other symbols to help us out: tools, workbench, etc. Isolating them, we rely on your title to tell us they are carpenter''s hands. I like the framing and cropping here, and the pose of the hands is also effective.</td>', 'Quite dark here, and perhaps these hands could use a few other symbols to help us out: tools, workbench, etc. Isolating them, we rely on your title to tell us they are carpenter''s hands. I like the framing and cropping here, and the pose of the hands is also effective.', '2004-10-17 23:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(963145, 111703, 6870, '<td valign="top">She sure has red hair! This lovely woman is portrayed with red hair and a delightful expression. Your lighting is a bit harsh and unwelcoming, but still a flattering portrait.</td>', 'She sure has red hair! This lovely woman is portrayed with red hair and a delightful expression. Your lighting is a bit harsh and unwelcoming, but still a flattering portrait.', '2004-10-17 23:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
