(963382, 111481, 10170, '<td valign="top">Wow, that amazes me.<br/> <br/>From just the eyes I have this image of a sex goddess, someone like Jessica Rabbit but for real .... and then I find out it is a 13 month old baby *laugh*<br/> <br/>Sensational Jacko .... and not an insect in sight ;)</td>', 'Wow, that amazes me. From just the eyes I have this image of a sex goddess, someone like Jessica Rabbit but for real .... and then I find out it is a 13 month old baby *laugh* Sensational Jacko .... and not an insect in sight ;)', '2004-10-18 02:15:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(963406, 111547, 14386, '<td valign="top">I am so pleased with the results. A week ago I said that my goal in DPChallenge is to get a Blue and an 8.  This picture does it for me.  Now I can take a rest....for a while.<br/> <br/>This shot almost didn''t happen. After taking so many pictures of EYES of my three students, Noon, my student in my last period class that day, asked me if I would like to take her picture with the same veil that Megha (another student whom I photographed earlier) used. Just to appease her, I said "why not".  So I brought her out of the classroom, and hurriedly took 7 shots...and this was one of them.<br/> <br/>Thanks to a very good friend who helped me in the PP.  And thanks to Noon, my model.<br/> <br/>Those who voted, many many thanks. Now I can concentrate more in my schoolwork since my goal this year has already been achieved.<br/> <br/>BUT...if you see pictures of Chinese or China in two weeks, it''s from me. I will be going to the Yunnan Province this weekend (and for the entire next week).<br/> <br/>Manny<br/></td>', 'I am so pleased with the results. A week ago I said that my goal in DPChallenge is to get a Blue and an 8.  This picture does it for me.  Now I can take a rest....for a while. This shot almost didn''t happen. After taking so many pictures of EYES of my three students, Noon, my student in my last period class that day, asked me if I would like to take her picture with the same veil that Megha (another student whom I photographed earlier) used. Just to appease her, I said "why not".  So I brought her out of the classroom, and hurriedly took 7 shots...and this was one of them. Thanks to a very good friend who helped me in the PP.  And thanks to Noon, my model. Those who voted, many many thanks. Now I can concentrate more in my schoolwork since my goal this year has already been achieved. BUT...if you see pictures of Chinese or China in two weeks, it''s from me. I will be going to the Yunnan Province this weekend (and for the entire next week). Manny', '2004-10-18 02:27:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(963409, 111474, 9089, '<td valign="top">Annasense, just wondering why you marked every comment on this picture helpful except for mine?  <br/> <br/>I''m hoping you didn''t take it that I was ignoring your photo, but rather that was the feeling that he was giving me in looking at the picture.  <br/> <br/>After looking at the photo more, the eyes looking over my left shoulder make my eyes go look over his left shoulder which gives me the background with the really bright/overblown highlights.  This makes me ignore what you really wanted me to look at in his eyes.  Just sit and stare straight at his eyes for 30 seconds (try not to let your eyes wander) and see what you want to do...<br/> <br/>Two other things on the photo, the sheen on his nose and cheekand the overblown highlights in the background, with just a touch of the burn, that would go away and give a better picture.  <br/> <br/>Also, like others have said, bump the contrast up just a bit.</td>', 'Annasense, just wondering why you marked every comment on this picture helpful except for mine?   I''m hoping you didn''t take it that I was ignoring your photo, but rather that was the feeling that he was giving me in looking at the picture.   After looking at the photo more, the eyes looking over my left shoulder make my eyes go look over his left shoulder which gives me the background with the really bright/overblown highlights.  This makes me ignore what you really wanted me to look at in his eyes.  Just sit and stare straight at his eyes for 30 seconds (try not to let your eyes wander) and see what you want to do... Two other things on the photo, the sheen on his nose and cheekand the overblown highlights in the background, with just a touch of the burn, that would go away and give a better picture.   Also, like others have said, bump the contrast up just a bit.', '2004-10-18 02:27:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(963420, 110172, 21245, '<td valign="top">Thank you so much to everyone who took the time to vote on my picture, and especially to comment.  I really tried to be creative within the bounds of the topic, and I am very pleased to see it was appreciated.  These shots were a lot of work to set up, be we had a ton of fun with them.<br/> <br/>This is my highest placing, and ranking thus far, and my first submission to receive not a single 1!</td>', 'Thank you so much to everyone who took the time to vote on my picture, and especially to comment.  I really tried to be creative within the bounds of the topic, and I am very pleased to see it was appreciated.  These shots were a lot of work to set up, be we had a ton of fun with them. This is my highest placing, and ranking thus far, and my first submission to receive not a single 1!', '2004-10-18 02:32:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(963428, 111481, 19708, '<td valign="top">WOW!<br/>Jacques, you have done well without a bug for a change. Seriously though, this is a stunning shot! I can see this as a magazine cosmetics ad background.</td>', 'WOW!Jacques, you have done well without a bug for a change. Seriously though, this is a stunning shot! I can see this as a magazine cosmetics ad background.', '2004-10-18 02:37:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(963432, 111473, 19708, '<td valign="top">Wow John, Well Done again, and now your highest rated ribbon so far.<br/>Keep up the vision - it is working well !<br/>Great tone in this shot too BTW.</td>', 'Wow John, Well Done again, and now your highest rated ribbon so far.Keep up the vision - it is working well !Great tone in this shot too BTW.', '2004-10-18 02:39:00.000000', NULL, 0),
