(963476, 111864, 16790, '<td valign="top">Just a note... the idea wasn''t to make him look innocent, so there''s no way he was faking it.  Actually, I was originally going to have him look a bit grouchy and do an attitude one, which is the face he was trying to make, but he just ended up looking rather cute and innocent to me. (I was going to do attitude because I woke him up from napping to model for me before the challenge ended... enough said. :))<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-10-18 02:35:15.</i></td>', 'Just a note... the idea wasn''t to make him look innocent, so there''s no way he was faking it.  Actually, I was originally going to have him look a bit grouchy and do an attitude one, which is the face he was trying to make, but he just ended up looking rather cute and innocent to me. (I was going to do attitude because I woke him up from napping to model for me before the challenge ended... enough said. :))', '2004-10-18 03:34:13.000000', '2004-10-18 03:35:15.000000', 0),
(963484, 111232, 9089, '<td valign="top">For anyone interested, here''s the original...<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=113745" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/9089/thumb/113745.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/9089/thumb/113745.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/9089/thumb/113745.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>It was fun taking this lady''s picture. I was going around to some Orthodox churches looking for someone to take a picture of, and saw her walk up, started talking to her, and I had my camera to the side of me on a monopod, and as she was talking to me (she was looking right at me), I was snapping pictures off to the side not knowing how they were being composed. I had to crop a bunch to get it the way I liked.</td>', 'For anyone interested, here''s the original...  It was fun taking this lady''s picture. I was going around to some Orthodox churches looking for someone to take a picture of, and saw her walk up, started talking to her, and I had my camera to the side of me on a monopod, and as she was talking to me (she was looking right at me), I was snapping pictures off to the side not knowing how they were being composed. I had to crop a bunch to get it the way I liked.', '2004-10-18 04:08:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(963490, 111547, 18897, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot and finally you''ve gotten your way overdue blue!</td>', 'Fantastic shot and finally you''ve gotten your way overdue blue!', '2004-10-18 04:42:35.000000', NULL, 0),
