(963509, 111728, 93, '<td valign="top">Haha! I thought is was you!  My favorite of the challenge.  Once again, you floor me with something that *should* be hum-drum cliche by now, but in your hands remains fresh and fascinating.</td>', 'Haha! I thought is was you!  My favorite of the challenge.  Once again, you floor me with something that *should* be hum-drum cliche by now, but in your hands remains fresh and fascinating.', '2004-10-18 05:44:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(963514, 111661, 93, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe you stole the brown ribbon from me! :)<br/> <br/>I actually gave this shot a 6.. I thought it was pretty good, if a little uneventful.. but if rage isn''t a defining feature of The Hulk, I don''t know what is! <br/> <br/>Feel proud.. the brown isn''t easy, especially when you''re *not* trying for it.</td>', 'I can''t believe you stole the brown ribbon from me! :) I actually gave this shot a 6.. I thought it was pretty good, if a little uneventful.. but if rage isn''t a defining feature of The Hulk, I don''t know what is!  Feel proud.. the brown isn''t easy, especially when you''re *not* trying for it.', '2004-10-18 05:49:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(963517, 111547, 2798, '<td valign="top">My only 10 for this challenge. A well deserved win. Congratulations.</td>', 'My only 10 for this challenge. A well deserved win. Congratulations.', '2004-10-18 05:54:08.000000', NULL, 0),
