(963547, 111772, 10390, '<td valign="top">Wow, lucky you that marbo did take part in this challenge.  The only way is up... well almost, hehe... Good luck with your next submission, I''ll bet you''ll do better next time, if you do not I''ll buy you a Fresca! :-P</td>', 'Wow, lucky you that marbo did take part in this challenge.  The only way is up... well almost, hehe... Good luck with your next submission, I''ll bet you''ll do better next time, if you do not I''ll buy you a Fresca! :-P', '2004-10-18 07:03:10.000000', NULL, 0),
