(979305, 111862, 26045, '<td valign="top"><br/>Thanks everyone! I appreciate the comments!<br/> <br/>I know this one didn''t realllly make the challenge, but I was going more for personality/behavior traits than physical features. Of all the shots, this one did it for me. I''m not too concerned with where I placed in the challenge, but just that I ENTERED the challenge ahaha.<br/> <br/>I appreciate the suggestions for improvement, too. Thank you all!<br/> <br/>Katy</td>', 'Thanks everyone! I appreciate the comments! I know this one didn''t realllly make the challenge, but I was going more for personality/behavior traits than physical features. Of all the shots, this one did it for me. I''m not too concerned with where I placed in the challenge, but just that I ENTERED the challenge ahaha. I appreciate the suggestions for improvement, too. Thank you all! Katy', '2004-10-29 14:07:35.000000', NULL, 0),
